### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)*
Theo mặc định, hệ thống sẽ tự động tạo tên quảng cáo. Bạn có thể tùy chỉnh tên quảng cáo bằng cách chỉ định một tên hợp lệ.
ad_name
• To have the system auto-generate the ad name, set this field to ""(empty string). • To customize the ad name, specify a non-empty string value.

Chi tiết nguồn sản phẩm · Danh sách sản phẩm (Products)
Một trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)
product_specific_type product_set_id product_ids
Set product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available generic catalog products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each generic catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3).

Destination URL
Bật (Enabled)
landing_page_url_list
Specify a valid URL. Users will be directed to your product links, TikTok Instant Page, or the specified link depending on where they’re most likely to convert.

page_list
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

UTM parameters *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
utm_params
Specify valid values or not specified If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.

Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity)
Any of the following options: • Custom User (custom identity) • Authorized User • TikTok User • TikTok Account User in Business Center
identity_type
Any of the following values: • CUSTOMIZED_USER • AUTH_CODE • TT_USER • BC_AUTH_TT **Note**:  • For non-Spark Ads identities (CUSTOMIZED_USER), specify values to identity_type and identity_id in the ad_configuration object. • For Spark Ads identities, specify values to identity_type and identity_id within the creative_info object.

identity_id
Specify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).

identity_authorized_bc_id
Specify a valid value when identity_type is BC_AUTH_TT

Creative assets · Autoselect from catalog
Any of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Web Generic Catalog Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-web-generic-catalog-ads/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1). • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products.The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • When using a non-Spark Ad identity: • Specify 1-50 videos with cover images • Specify 1-5 ad texts • When using a Spark Ad identity: • 1-50 TikTok video posts • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.
catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list tiktok_item_id ad_format
• To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Web Generic Catalog Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-web-generic-catalog-ads/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1). • **Note**: music_info is Bắt buộc khi catalog_creative_toggle is true. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false, and specify any of the following: • If identity_type in the ad_configuration object is CUSTOMIZED_USER: • one to 50 videos (video_info) with cover images (image_info) and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list). • set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO • If identity_type within the creative_info object is AUTH_CODE, TT_USER or BC_AUTH_TT: • one to 50 TikTok video posts through tiktok_item_id. Do not pass video_info, image_info, and ad_text_list. • set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO

Creative assets · Catalog creative settings
Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with one to two of the following types: • **Image** • **Product video URL**
catalog_creative_toggle catalog_media_settings
• To disable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Leave catalog_media_settings unspecified. • To enable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to true. • Provide one to two of the following values in catalog_media_settings: • IMAGE • TEMPLATE_VIDEO

Tài sản sáng tạo · Lời kêu gọi hành động (Call to action)
Any of the following options: • Dynamic • Standard **Note**: When you use a Spark Ads identity, you can only use dynamic call to action.
call_to_action_id call_to_action_list
• To use dynamic call to action, specify call_to_action_id. • To use standard call to action, specify call_to_action_list. **Note**: If you set identity_type within the creative_info object to TT_USER, BC_AUTH_TT, or AUTH_CODE, call_to_action_id is required.

Creative assets · Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
disclaimer
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Automatic enhancements · Product display settings · Product card settings
Any of the following options: • Product card • Product card and carousel label
product_card_type
Any of the following values: • ["PRODUCT_CARD"] • ["PRODUCT_CARD","CAROUSEL_LABEL"]

Automatic enhancements · Product display settings · Product information *(Không bắt buộc)*
• When the "Autoselect from catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to two product attributes to display alongside the Title in your ads: • Rating • Sale price • Price • Product description • City • Locations or regions • Street address • Custom label 0 • Custom label 1 • Custom label 2 • The selected product details will be automatically added from your catalog to your ads for best results. By default, only the title of each product or service will be displayed in your ads • When the "Autoselect from catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
catalog_tag_list
• When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Not specified or specify up to two attributes from the following values: • GENERIC_RATING • GENERIC_SALE_PRICE • GENERIC_PRICE • GENERIC_DESCRIPTION • GENERIC_ADDRESS_CITY • GENERIC_ADDRESS_REGION • GENERIC_ADDRESS_STREET • GENERIC_CUSTOM_LABEL_0 • GENERIC_CUSTOM_LABEL_1 • GENERIC_CUSTOM_LABEL_2 • The title of your product or service will be automatically displayed alongside the specified attributes in your ads. For example, if you set this field to ["GENERIC_RATING","GENERIC_DESCRIPTION"], the title, rating and description of your product or service will be displayed in your ads. By default, only the title of each product or service will be displayed in your ads. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

product_info_enabled
CATALOG

creative_auto_enhancement_strategy_list
[]

Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
tracking_app_id
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt hiển thị *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
impression_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt nhấp *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
click_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Cài đặt bên thứ ba · Theo dõi khả năng xem với đối tác bên thứ ba *(Không bắt buộc)*
Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.
viewability_postbid_partner
Not specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.

viewability_vast_url
Specify a valid value when viewability_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

Theo dõi · Cài đặt bên thứ ba · Đo lường an toàn thương hiệu với đối tác bên thứ ba *(Không bắt buộc)*
Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.
brand_safety_postbid_partner
Not specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to specify both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.

brand_safety_vast_url
Specify a valid value when brand_safety_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

### Tùy chỉnh kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo trong Quảng cáo danh mục chung trên web Upgraded Smart+
If you enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (`catalog_creative_toggle` is `true`), the system will automatically create ads using combinations of three possible formats: catalog carousel, catalog video, and single video.

The possible ad format combinations for your Upgraded Smart+ Web Generic Catalog Ads are illustrated in the following table.

| Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục có sẵn? | Video danh mục có sẵn? | Video đơn có sẵn? | Kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo cho Quảng cáo danh mục chung trên web Upgraded Smart+ |
|---|---|---|---|
| ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | Chỉ thẻ xoay vòng danh mục (Catalog carousel only) |
| ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video đơn |
| ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video danh mục |
| ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục, video danh mục và video đơn |

To ensure certain ad formats are available in Upgraded Smart+ Web Generic Catalog Ads, follow the instructions in the following table.

**Ad format**
**Ad format description**
**How to ensure the ad format is available**
**How to configure the parameters**

catalog carousel
Display 2–20 products in a slideshow format. This format will showcase product images of up to 20 products from your catalog at a time.
Enable "Image" in your catalog creative settings, allowing the system to use images from your catalogs in the ad.
Ensure IMAGE is included in the catalog_media_settings value.

The catalog needs to contain at least two products supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.
Ensure that the catalog (catalog_id) contains at least two approved products. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-overview-of-a-catalog/v1.3), which should be at least two. • Carousel image selection scope: The product images for products in a catalog (catalog_id) will be dynamically chosen as images in the delivering Catalog Carousel Ads. The scope of product images to choose from is determined by the specified product_specific_type parameter: • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from all products in the catalog. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from products in the specified product set (product_set_id). • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from a customized product range consisting of up to 20 products (product_ids). • Carousel image type: • Use the main images of the products: By default, the main image URLs of the dynamically selected catalog products will be used as Carousel images.

Specify a piece of music supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.
Pass one music ID that is valid for use in Catalog Carousel Ads via music_info. **Note**: To obtain a valid music ID, you can use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Catalog Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL in [/file/music/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-music-list/v1.3). • Upload a piece of customized music for Catalog Carousel Ads to an ad account by using any of the following methods: • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL and pass music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3). • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL, upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and pass file_id to [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3).

catalog video
Use videos from your catalog to promote your products.
Enable "Product video URL" in your catalog creative settings, allowing the system to use videos from your catalogs in the ad.
Ensure TEMPLATE_VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value.

You need to configure a video URL for each catalog product.
Ensure that a video URL (video_url) has been configured for each catalog product. • To ensure a video URL has been configured for each catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3) and check the returned video_url. • If you want to add video URLs for your catalog products, use [/catalog/product/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/update-products/v1.3).

single video
Use specified video creatives to promote your products.
Specify additional videos or TikTok video posts
Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both. • For Spark Ads Pull, specify additional TikTok video posts via tiktok_item_id. • For Spark Ads Push, specify additional videos via video_info and cover images via image_info.

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
    "landing_page_url_list": [
        {
            "landing_page_url": "{{landing_page_url}}"
        }
    ],
    "creative_list": [
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "CATALOG_CAROUSEL",
                "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT",
                "music_info": {
                    "music_id": "{{music_id}}"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "video_info": {
                    "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                },
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{web_uri}}"
                    }
                ],
                "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT"
            }
        }
    ],
    "ad_text_list": [
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        }
    ],
    "ad_configuration": {
        "product_specific_type": "ALL",
        "catalog_creative_toggle": true,
        "catalog_creative_info": {
            "catalog_media_settings": [
                "IMAGE",
                "TEMPLATE_VIDEO"
            ]
        },
        "utm_params": [
            {
                "key": "{{key}}",
                "value": "{{value}}"
            }
        ],
        "call_to_action_id": "{{call_to_action_id}}",
        "product_info": {
            "product_card_type": [
                "PRODUCT_CARD",
                "CAROUSEL_LABEL"
            ],
            "catalog_tag_list": [
                "GENERIC_RATING",
                "GENERIC_PRICE"
            ]
        },
        "product_info_enabled": "CATALOG",
        "creative_auto_enhancement_strategy_list": []
    }
}'
```
Phản hồi (Response)
