<a id="doc-1843324498993154"></a>
<!-- doc_id: 1843324498993154 -->
<!-- doc_id: 1843324498993154 -->
# Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm khách hàng tiềm năng Upgraded Smart+ (`Create Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaigns`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm khách hàng tiềm năng Upgraded Smart+
Bài viết này hướng dẫn bạn từng bước để tạo Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaigns.

Based on your preference for Có thực hiện use a catalog and optimization location, you can create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as Instant Form, Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as Website, Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as TikTok direct messages, Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as instant messaging apps, Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as phone call, Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads, or Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generic Catalog Ads.

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign without using a catalog and with optimization location as Instant Form, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with Location as Instant Form](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1843324592169986).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign without using a catalog and with optimization location as Website, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with Location as Website](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1843324606213121).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign without using a catalog and with optimization location as TikTok direct messages, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as TikTok direct messages](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1847302969710913).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign without using a catalog and with optimization location as instant messaging apps, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as instant messaging apps](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1847302988449921).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign without using a catalog and with optimization location as phone call, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign with optimization location as phone call](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1847302998941697).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign using an Auto-Inventory catalog or Auto-Model catalog, see [Create Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1843324618421314).

- To create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Campaign using a generic catalog, see [Create Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generic Catalog Ads](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1874421377372161).

