### Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)*
Theo mặc định, hệ thống sẽ tự động tạo tên quảng cáo. Bạn có thể tùy chỉnh tên quảng cáo bằng cách chỉ định một tên hợp lệ.
ad_name
• To have the system auto-generate the ad name, set this field to ""(empty string). • To customize the ad name, specify a non-empty string value.

Chi tiết nguồn sản phẩm · Danh sách sản phẩm (Products)
Một trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)
product_specific_type product_set_id product_ids
Set product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each Auto-Inventory or Auto-Model product, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402).

Identity · Select a TikTok account
Select a valid TikTok account
identity_type
Any of the following values: • TT_USER • BC_AUTH_TT If you want to use an identity in TikTok Direct Messaging Ads, you need to have direct message permission for the identity. To confirm this, call [/identity/get/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218420781057) or [/identity/info/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218453385217) and check Liệu returned can_manage_message is true. • If the returned can_manage_message is false and identity_type is TT_USER, you can navigate to [the ad account user setting page](https://ads.tiktok.com/ac/page/settings). In the **Profile** section of the **Personal Info** tab, click **Edit access** to edit your permissions for the associated TikTok account. Ensure that you have **"Read and manage messages in your inbox"** permission for the TikTok account. • If the returned can_manage_message is false and identity_type is BC_AUTH_TT, you can ask the Business Center admin to grant you direct message permission for the TikTok account associated with the identity by using [/bc/asset/assign/](../12-api-reference/15-bc-assets.md#doc-1739438211077121). Set asset_type to TT_ACCOUNT and ensure that the tt_account_roles value includes at least POST and DIRECT_MESSAGE.

identity_id
Specify a valid value. To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218420781057).

identity_authorized_bc_id
Specify a valid value when identity_type is BC_AUTH_TT

Điểm đến chuyển hướng (Destination)
TikTok direct message
page_list landing_page_url_list
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

Message template (Welcome message)
Enabled Greet people with an automatic message sent by your TikTok account after they start a direct message conversation from one of your ads.
auto_message_list
Specify a valid value. • To obtain a list of welcome messages within your ad account, use [/creative/auto_message/get/](../12-api-reference/73-welcome-messages.md#doc-1822106498804738). • To create a welcome message within your ad account, use [/creative/auto_message/create/](../12-api-reference/73-welcome-messages.md#doc-1822106113771521).

Creative assets · Create catalog carousel from your catalog
Any of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in the catalog solution for Upgraded Smart+ TikTok Direct Messaging Ads. • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • For Spark Ads Pull, specify video posts. • For Spark Ads Push, specify  videos with cover images. • Specify 1-5 ad texts **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.
catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list ad_format
• To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object,  and specify an end card image via image_info and a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in the catalog solution for Upgraded Smart+ TikTok Direct Messaging Ads. **Note**: When catalog_creative_toggle is true, both image_info and music_info are required. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false: • Set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO  and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list)  • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • To create Spark Ads by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify video posts through tiktok_item_id • To create Spark Ads by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify one to 50 videos through video_info with cover images through image_info

Creative assets · Product information (Optional for Auto-Inventory catalogs)
• When an **Auto-Inventory** catalog is specified at the ad group level and the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to two product attributes to display alongside the vehicle title in your ads: • Dealer name • Make • Model • Year • Mileage • Exterior color • Trim • City • State of vehicle • Price • Sale priceThe selected product details will be automatically added from your catalog to your ads for best results. By default, only the title of each product will be displayed in your ads • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
product_display_field_list
• When an **Auto-Inventory** catalog is specified throughcatalog_id at the ad group level and catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Not specified or specify up to two attributes from the following values: • DEALER_NAME • MAKE • MODEL • YEAR • MILEAGE • EXTERIOR_COLOR • TRIM • ADDRESS_CITY • VEHICLE_STATE • PRICE • SALE_PRICEThe title of your vehicle will be automatically displayed alongside the specified attributes in your ads. For example, if you set this field to ["MAKE","PRICE"], the title, make and price of your vehicle will be displayed in your ads. By default, only the title of each product will be displayed in your ads. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Tài sản sáng tạo · Thẻ kết thúc (End card)
• When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled. Select the last photo to appear in the carousel to encourage people to browse your full inventory. • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled-
image_info
• When catalog_creative_toggle is true: • Specify one end card. The end card will be displayed at the end of the carousel. To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1739067433456642) or [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506). The image should meet the following requirements at the same time: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506) for the image is true. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Creative assets · Call to action for end card
• When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled with one of the following options: • Search inventory (Recommended) • Learn more • Shop now • Sign up • Contact us • Book now • Read more • View now • Order now • Send message • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
end_card_cta
• When catalog_creative_toggle is true: • Enabled with any of the following values: • SEARCH_INVENTORY (Recommended) • LEARN_MORE • SHOP_NOW • SIGN_UP • CONTACT_US • BOOK_NOW • READ_MORE • VIEW_MORE • ORDER_NOW • SEND_MESSAGE • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Creative assets · Disclaimer (Optional for the Auto-Model catalog)
• When an **Auto-Model** catalog is specified at the ad group level and the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following options: • Emission disclaimer • Discount or offer disclaimer **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission disclaimer • emission disclaimer URL • emission overlay disclaimer • emission image • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer disclaimer • offer disclaimer URL • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
auto_disclaimer_types
• When an **Auto-Model** catalog is specified throughcatalog_id at the ad group level and catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following values: • EMISSION • DISCOUNT **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission_disclaimer • emission_disclaimer_url • emission_overlay_disclaimer • emission_image_link • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer_disclaimer • offer_disclaimer_urlTo get the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402). To update the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/update/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740562287852546). • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Lời kêu gọi hành động (Call to Action - CTA)
Send message
call_to_action_id
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

