Interactive add-on *(Không bắt buộc)*
Disabled or Enabled with an Inventory Card When the Interactive add-on is enabled: • For Automotive Ads for Inventory or  Automotive Ads for Models with Single Video format, auto-generated Vehicle Cards will be shown after two seconds of video play. If the audience continues swiping through the Vehicle Cards, the Inventory Card will be displayed at the end. • The Vehicle Cards showcase the following attributes of the vehicle as defined in the catalog, and a CTA button, which will direct users to the third-party landing page. • Main image • Title • State of the vehicle • Mileage • Price • The Inventory Card includes: • A customized image • A customized description • Estimated catalog size • CTA button "Search Inventory", which directs the audience to an auto-generated Instant Product Page
interactive_add_on_list
Not specified, or specify the ID of an Inventory Card portfolio. To get the Inventory Card portfolio ID (creative_portfolio_id), see [Cards](../09-marketing-api/creatives.md#doc-1749019652141058). **Note**: You can update the Inventory Card portfolio in your Automotive Ads for Inventory or Automotive Ads for Models to a different Inventory Card portfolio. When the Interactive add-on is enabled: • The Vehicle Cards showcase a CTA button and the following attributes of the vehicle: • image_url • title • state_of_vehicle • mileage • price • To get the attributes of a vehicle, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402). • The Inventory Card includes a CTA button, estimated catalog size, and the following attributes of the Inventory Card: • image_id • description • To get the details of an Inventory Card, use [/creative/portfolio/list/](../12-api-reference/36-creative-portfolios.md#doc-1766324010279938).

