        "schedule_end_time": "{{schedule_end_time}}",
        "schedule_start_time": "{{schedule_start_time}}",
        "schedule_type": "SCHEDULE_START_END",
        "search_result_enabled": false,
        "secondary_status": "ADGROUP_STATUS_CREATE",
        "share_disabled": false,
        "targeting_optimization_mode": "AUTOMATIC",
        "targeting_spec": {
            "actions": [],
            "age_groups": [
                "AGE_18_24",
                "AGE_25_34",
                "AGE_35_44",
                "AGE_45_54",
                "AGE_55_100"
            ],
            "brand_safety_type": "LIMITED_INVENTORY",
            "category_exclusion_ids": [
                "{{category_exclusion_ids}}"
            ],
            "gender": "GENDER_UNLIMITED",
            "location_ids": [
                "{{location_ids}}"
            ],
            "spc_audience_age": "OVER_EIGHTEEN",
            "spending_power": "ALL"
        },
        "video_download_disabled": false
    }
}
```

### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)*
Theo mặc định, hệ thống sẽ tự động tạo tên quảng cáo. Bạn có thể tùy chỉnh tên quảng cáo bằng cách chỉ định một tên hợp lệ.
ad_name
• To have the system auto-generate the ad name, set this field to ""(empty string). • To customize the ad name, specify a non-empty string value.

Điểm đến chuyển hướng (Destination)
To learn about how to configure the setting, see Destination and tracking message event set options for different scenarios.
landing_page_url_list page_list
To learn about how to configure these parameters, see Destination and tracking message event set options for different scenarios.

Creative assets · Ad creatives & Ad text
For a single ad, you can include one to **50 ad creatives**that can consist of the following types: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about the combination of available ad creatives based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1847839781968897).
ad_format
Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ

creative_list video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list tiktok_item_id
Specify one to 50 ad creatives through creative_list. The ad creatives can be any of the following: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about configurations of the available ad creative combinations based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1847839781968897).

Add product and service information *(Không bắt buộc)*
Tắt (Disabled)
N/A
N/A

Lời kêu gọi hành động (Call to Action - CTA)
Động (Dynamic)
call_to_action_id
Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ

call_to_action_list
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

Tuyên bố từ chối trách nhiệm *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
disclaimer
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
tracking_app_id
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Tracking · TikTok events tracking · Website *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
tracking_pixel_id
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Tracking · TikTok events tracking · Message event set *(Không bắt buộc)*
To learn about how to configure the setting, see Destination and tracking message event set options for different scenarios.
tracking_message_event_set_id
To learn about how to configure the parameter, see Destination and tracking message event set options for different scenarios.

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt hiển thị *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
impression_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt nhấp *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
click_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

### Tùy chọn điểm đến và bộ sự kiện tin nhắn theo dõi theo kịch bản
The following table illustrates the available ad destination and tracking message event set options based on your ad group settings for instant messaging app (or customized URL) and optimization goal. Learn how to set up parameters for each option.

Instant messaging app or customized URL
(messaging_app_type)
Available optimization goals
(optimization_goal)
Available Destinations
How to configure the Destination
How to configure Tracking message event set
(tracking_message_event_set_id)

Messenger (MESSENGER)
Click (CLICK)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with a message event set (tracking_message_event_set_id) to measure.

Trang tức thì TikTok (TikTok Instant Page)
Specify a TikTok Instant Page via page_list and do not specifylanding_page_url_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The page_list needs to match the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level. • To confirm Liệu page_list matches the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level, use [/page/get/](../12-api-reference/54-page.md#doc-1820826387779586) and check the returned messaging_app_type and messaging_app_account_id.
Tắt (Disabled)

Conversations (CONVERSATION)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

WhatsApp (WHATSAPP)
Click (CLICK)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list and page_list. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with a message event set (tracking_message_event_set_id) to measure.

Trang tức thì TikTok (TikTok Instant Page)
Specify a TikTok Instant Page via page_list and do not specifylanding_page_url_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The page_list needs to match the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level. • To confirm Liệu page_list matches the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level, use [/page/get/](../12-api-reference/54-page.md#doc-1820826387779586) and check the returned messaging_app_type and messaging_app_account_id.
Tắt (Disabled)

Conversations (CONVERSATION)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Zalo (ZALO)
Click (CLICK)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Trang tức thì TikTok (TikTok Instant Page)
Specify a TikTok Instant Page via page_list and do not specifylanding_page_url_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The page_list needs to match the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Conversations (CONVERSATION)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Line (LINE)
Click (CLICK)
Instant messaging apps
Do not specify landing_page_url_list, page_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The system will automatically populate landing_page_url_list based on your instant messaging app setting at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Trang tức thì TikTok (TikTok Instant Page)
Specify a TikTok Instant Page via page_list and do not specifylanding_page_url_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. The page_list needs to match the same instant messaging app information at the ad group level.
Tắt (Disabled)

Instant Messaging URL (IM_URL)
Click (CLICK)
Instant messaging apps
Manually specify the Instant messaging URL and do not pass page_list. • To specify the Instant messaging URL as Apple’s universal link or Android App Link: • Set landing_page_url_list to a link starting with http:// or https://. • Do not pass deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type. • To specify the Instant messaging URL as a Custom URL scheme of an Instant messaging app: • Set deeplink to a link in the format of scheme://resource. For instance, a Custom URL scheme of WhatsApp should follow the format whatsapp://resource. • Set deeplink_type to NORMAL. • Set fallback_type to WEBSITE. • Set landing_page_url_list to a fallback URL, in the format of Apple’s universal link or Android App Link starting with http:// or https://. **Note**: To verify Liệu a URL is a valid Apple’s universal link or Android App Link, or Custom URL scheme, pass the URL to the parameter url in [/tool/url_validate/](../12-api-reference/70-tools-p2.md#doc-1774487686007810).
Tắt (Disabled)

Trang tức thì TikTok (TikTok Instant Page)
Specify a TikTok Instant Page via page_list and do not specify landing_page_url_list, deeplink, deeplink_type, and fallback_type.

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)

#### Destination as Instant messaging apps
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
    "creative_list": [
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "CAROUSEL_ADS",
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{web_uri}}"
                    }
                ],
                "music_info": {
                    "music_id": "{{music_id}}"
                },
                "identity_type": "TT_USER",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}"
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "video_info": {
                    "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                },
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{web_uri}}"
                    }
                ],
                "identity_type": "TT_USER",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}"
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "tiktok_item_id": "{{tiktok_item_id}}",
                "identity_type": "TT_USER",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}"
            }
        }
    ],
    "ad_text_list": [
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        },
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        }
    ],
    "ad_configuration": {
        "call_to_action_id": "{{call_to_action_id}}"
    }
}'
```
