### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
DestinationSpecify at least two of the following destinations and make sure the destinations match your ad group level optimization location combination: • Website URL • Instant Form • Message templatemulti_dest_listSpecify valid values. To learn about the valid values, see Available destinations for different optimization location combinations.
Creative assets · IdentityAny of the following options: • Custom User (custom identity) • Authorized User • TikTok User • TikTok Account User in Business Centeridentity_typeAny of the following values: • CUSTOMIZED_USER • AUTH_CODE • TT_USER • BC_AUTH_TT **Note**: • For non-Spark Ads identities (CUSTOMIZED_USER), specify values to identity_type and identity_id in the ad_configuration object. • For Spark Ads identities, specify values to identity_type and identity_id within the creative_info object.
identity_idSpecify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Creative assets · Ad creatives & Ad textFor a single ad, you can include one to **50 ad creatives **that can consist of the following types: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about the combination of available ad creatives based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3).ad_formatSpecify a valid value
creative_listvideo_infoimage_infomusic_infoad_text_listtiktok_item_idSpecify one to 50 ad creatives through creative_list. The ad creatives can be any of the following: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about configurations of the available ad creative combinations based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3).
Call to actionDynamiccall_to_action_idSpecify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Interactive add-ons *(Không bắt buộc)* (When the ad creatives include videos or video photos )Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to one add-on in any of the following types: • Display Card • Countdown Sticker • Gift Code Stickerinteractive_add_on_listNot specified or specify up to one ID of any of the following add-on types: • Countdown Sticker • Gift Code Sticker • Display Card **Note**: • You can only use add-ons when creative_list contains video creatives, including videos and TikTok video posts. To create an interactive add-on (creative portfolio), use [/creative/portfolio/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-portfolio/v1.3). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Display Card portfolio, see [Cards](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/cards/v1.3#anchor-1-1). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Countdown Sticker or Gift Code Sticker portfolio, see [Stickers](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/stickers/v1.3).
