### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)*
Theo mặc định, hệ thống sẽ tự động tạo tên quảng cáo. Bạn có thể tùy chỉnh tên quảng cáo bằng cách chỉ định một tên hợp lệ.
ad_name
• To have the system auto-generate the ad name, set this field to ""(empty string). • To customize the ad name, specify a non-empty string value.

Chi tiết nguồn sản phẩm · Danh sách sản phẩm (Products)
Một trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)
product_specific_type product_set_id product_ids
Set product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each Auto-Inventory product, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402).

Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity)
Custom User (custom identity)
identity_type
CUSTOMIZED_USER **Note**: • For non-Spark Ads identities (CUSTOMIZED_USER), specify values to identity_type and identity_id in the ad_configuration object.

identity_id
Specify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218420781057).

identity_authorized_bc_id
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

Điểm đến chuyển hướng (Destination)
• When at the ad group level, Optimization Location is Website: • **Website URL**: Your own URL to direct users to browse inventory on your website. • When at the ad group level, Optimization Location is Instant Form: • **Instant Form**: An Instant Form that opens instantly when someone interacts with your ad.
landing_page_url_list page_list
• When at the ad group level promotion_target_type is EXTERNAL_WEBSITE: • Specify your own URL via landing_page_url_list. • Do not specify page_list. • When at the ad group level promotion_target_type is INSTANT_PAGE: • Specify the ID of an Instant Form through page_list. • To obtain the ID of an Instant Form, set business_type to LEAD_GEN in [/page/get/](../12-api-reference/54-page.md#doc-1820826387779586). • To create an Instant Form, use [Instant Page Editor SDK](../09-marketing-api/creatives.md#doc-1740307202170881) and set businessType to 1. • Do not specify landing_page_url_list.

UTM parameters (Optional for Website URL)
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
utm_params
Whenlanding_page_url_list is specified: • Specify valid values or not specified.If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.

Creative assets · Create catalog carousel from your catalog
Any of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads. • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products.The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • When using a non-Spark Ad identity: • Specify 1-50 videos with cover images • Specify 1-5 ad texts • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.
catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list ad_format
• To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify an end card image via image_info and a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads. • **Note**: When catalog_creative_toggle is true, both image_info and music_info are required. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false, and specify the following: • one to 50 videos (video_info) with cover images (image_info) and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list). • set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO

tiktok_item_id
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

Creative assets · Product information *(Không bắt buộc)*
• When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to two product attributes to display alongside the vehicle title in your ads: • Dealer name • Make • Model • Year • Mileage • Exterior color • Trim • City • State of vehicle • Price • Sale priceThe selected product details will be automatically added from your catalog to your ads for best results. By default, only the title of each product will be displayed in your ads • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
product_display_field_list
• When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Not specified or specify up to two attributes from the following values: • DEALER_NAME • MAKE • MODEL • YEAR • MILEAGE • EXTERIOR_COLOR • TRIM • ADDRESS_CITY • VEHICLE_STATE • PRICE • SALE_PRICEThe title of your vehicle will be automatically displayed alongside the specified attributes in your ads. For example, if you set this field to ["MAKE","PRICE"], the title, make and price of your vehicle will be displayed in your ads. By default, only the title of each product will be displayed in your ads. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Tài sản sáng tạo · Thẻ kết thúc (End card)
• When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled. Select the last photo to appear in the carousel to encourage people to browse your full inventory. • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
image_info
• When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Specify one end card. The end card will be displayed at the end of the carousel. • To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1739067433456642) or [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506). • The image should meet the following requirements at the same time: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506) for the image is true. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Creative assets · Call to action for end card
• When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled with one of the following options: • Search inventory (Recommended) • Learn more • Shop now • Sign up • Contact us • Book now • Read more • View now • Order now • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabled
end_card_cta
• When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Enabled with any of the following values: • SEARCH_INVENTORY (Recommended) • LEARN_MORE • SHOP_NOW • SIGN_UP • CONTACT_US • BOOK_NOW • READ_MORE • VIEW_MORE • ORDER_NOW • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified

Lời kêu gọi hành động (Call to Action - CTA)
Enabled with a standard call to action
call_to_action_id
Không chỉ định (Not specified)

call_to_action_list
Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ

Interactive add-ons
Enabled with an Inventory Card For Automotive Ads for Inventory with Single Video format, auto-generated Vehicle Cards will be shown after two seconds of video play. If the audience continues swiping through the Vehicle Cards, the Inventory Card will be displayed at the end. The Vehicle Cards showcase the following attributes of the vehicle as defined in the catalog, and a CTA button, which will direct users to the third-party landing page. • Main image • Title • State of the vehicle • Mileage • Price The Inventory Card includes: • A customized image • A customized description • Estimated catalog size • CTA button "Search Inventory", which directs the audience to an auto-generated Instant Product Page
interactive_add_on_list
Specify the ID of an Inventory Card portfolio. To get the Inventory Card portfolio ID (creative_portfolio_id), see [Cards](../09-marketing-api/creatives.md#doc-1749019652141058). **Note**: You can update the Inventory Card portfolio in your Automotive Ads for Inventory to a different Inventory Card portfolio. The Vehicle Cards showcase a CTA button and the following attributes of the vehicle: • image_url • title • state_of_vehicle • mileage • priceTo get the attributes of a vehicle, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402). The Inventory Card includes a CTA button, estimated catalog size, and the following attributes of the Inventory Card: • image_id • descriptionTo get the details of an Inventory Card, use [/creative/portfolio/list/](../12-api-reference/36-creative-portfolios.md#doc-1766324010279938).

This ad contains AI-generated content *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
aigc_disclosure_type
SELF_DISCLOSURE or NOT_DECLARED

Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
tracking_app_id
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Tracking · TikTok events tracking · Website (Optional when Optimization Location is Instant Form)
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
tracking_pixel_id
When at the ad group level, promotion_target_type is INSTANT_PAGE: • Specify a valid value or not specified

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt hiển thị *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
impression_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

Theo dõi · Cài đặt theo dõi bên thứ ba · URL theo dõi lượt nhấp *(Không bắt buộc)*
Bật hoặc tắt (Enabled hoặc Disabled)
click_tracking_url
Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định

### Tùy chỉnh kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo trong Quảng cáo ô tô Upgraded Smart+
If you enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (catalog_creative_toggle is true) in your Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads, the system will automatically create ads using combinations of two possible formats: catalog carousel, and single video.

The possible ad format combinations for your Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads are illustrated in the following table.

Định dạng thẻ xoay vòng danh mục có sẵn?
Định dạng video đơn có sẵn?
Ad format combination for your Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads

✅
❌
Chỉ thẻ xoay vòng danh mục

✅
✅
Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video đơn

To ensure certain ad formats are available in Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Ads, follow the instructions in the following table.

Định dạng quảng cáo (Ad format)
Ad format description
How to ensure the ad format is available
How to configure the parameters

catalog carousel
Display 2–20 products in a slideshow format. This format will showcase product images of up to 20 products from your catalog at a time.
The catalog needs to contain at least two products supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.
Ensure that the catalog (catalog_id) contains at least two approved products. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](../12-api-reference/25-catalog-management.md#doc-1740492470201345), which should be at least two. • Carousel image selection scope: The product images for products in a catalog (catalog_id) will be dynamically chosen as images in the delivering Catalog Carousel Ads. The scope of product images to choose from is determined by the specified product_specific_type parameter: • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from all products in the catalog. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from products in the specified product set (product_set_id). • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from a customized product range consisting of up to 20 products (product_ids). •  Carousel image type: • Use the main images of the products: By default, the main image URLs of the dynamically selected catalog products will be used as Carousel images.

Specify a piece of music supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.
Pass one music ID that is valid for use in Catalog Carousel Ads via music_info. To obtain a valid music ID, you can use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Catalog Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL in [/file/music/get/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740053909509122). • Upload a piece of customized music for Catalog Carousel Ads to an ad account by using any of the following methods: • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL and pass music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740052650395650). • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL, upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and pass file_id to [/file/music/upload/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740052650395650).

Specify an end card image
Pass one end card image that is valid for use in Automotive Catalog Carousel Ads via image_info. • To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1739067433456642) or [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506). • The image should meet the following requirements at the same time: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506) for the image is true.

single video
Use specified video creatives to promote your products.
Specify additional videos
Specify additional videos via video_info and cover images via image_info.

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)

#### Khi điểm đến là URL trang web (Website URL)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \\
--header 'Access-Token: "{{Access-Token}}"' \\
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
    "landing_page_url_list": [
        {
            "landing_page_url": "{{landing_page_url}}"
        }
    ],
    "creative_list": [
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format":"SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{image_uri}}"
                    }
                ],
                "video_info": {
                    "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format":"CATALOG_CAROUSEL",
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{image_uri}}"
                    }
                ],
                "music_info": {
                    "music_id": "{{music_id}}"
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "ad_text_list": [
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        }
    ],
    "call_to_action_list": [
        {
            "call_to_action": "CHECK_AVAILABILITY"
        }
    ],
    "interactive_add_on_list": [
        {
            "card_id": "{{card_id}}"
        }
    ],
    "ad_configuration": {
        "identity_type": "CUSTOMIZED_USER",
        "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
        "product_specific_type": "ALL",
        "catalog_creative_toggle": true,
        "end_card_cta": "ORDER_NOW"
    }
}'
```
Phản hồi (Response)
```http
// curl
{
    "code": 0,
    "message": "OK",
    "request_id": "{{request_id}}",
    "data": {
        "ad_configuration": {
            "catalog_creative_toggle": true,
            "end_card_cta": "ORDER_NOW",
            "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
            "identity_type": "CUSTOMIZED_USER",
            "product_specific_type": "ALL",
            "tracking_info": {},
            "utm_params": []
        },
        "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
        "ad_text_list": [
            {
                "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
            }
        ],
        "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
        "adgroup_name": "{{adgroup_name}}",
        "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
        "call_to_action_list": [
            {
                "call_to_action": "CHECK_AVAILABILITY"
            }
        ],
        "campaign_id": "{{campaign_id}}",
        "campaign_name": "{{campaign_name}}",
        "create_time": "{{create_time}}",
        "creative_list": [
            {
                "ad_material_id": "{{ad_material_id}}",
                "creative_info": {
                    "ad_format":"SINGLE_VIDEO",
                    "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                    "identity_type": "CUSTOMIZED_USER",
                    "image_info": [
                        {
                            "web_uri": "{{image_uri}}"
                        }
                    ],
                    "material_name": "",
                    "video_info": {
                        "file_name": "",
                        "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                    }
                },
                "material_operation_status": "ENABLE"
            },
            {
                "ad_material_id": "{{ad_material_id}}",
                "creative_info": {
                    "ad_format":"CATALOG_CAROUSEL",
                    "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                    "identity_type": "CUSTOMIZED_USER",
