<a id="doc-1873144295333889"></a>
<!-- doc_id: 1873144295333889 -->
<!-- doc_id: 1873144295333889 -->
# Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ (`Create Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaigns`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+
This article guides you through the steps to create Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaigns.

A Search Ads Campaign is a TikTok Ad Campaign that uses keywords to help you reach users searching for specific terms related to your product or service. With these campaigns, you have full control over ads targeted exclusively to the TikTok Search Results Page.

Based on your advertising objective, you can create one of the following campaign types:

- To get more people to install and take desired actions in your app, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ App Promotion Search Ads Campaign](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1873147546166737).
- To collect leads for your business, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Search Ads Campaign](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1873147560720593).
- To drive sales on your website or app, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Sales Search Ads Campaign](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743103825537).

---

<a id="doc-1873147546166737"></a>
<!-- doc_id: 1873147546166737 -->
<!-- doc_id: 1873147546166737 -->
# Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm quảng bá ứng dụng Upgraded Smart+ (`Create an Upgraded Smart+ App Promotion Search Ads Campaign`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm quảng bá ứng dụng Upgraded Smart+
This article explains how to create an Upgraded Smart+ App Promotion Search Ads Campaign.

Depending on Liệu you need to run an iOS 14 Dedicated Campaign (DC), you can create either a non-DC or a DC App Search Ads Campaign. For detailed instructions on both configurations, refer to the following articles:
- [Create an Upgraded Smart+ non-DC App Search Ads Campaign](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1873147575660753)
- [Create an Upgraded Smart+ DC App Search Ads Campaign](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1873147588534657)

