### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
DestinationInstant Formpage_listSpecify the page ID of an Instant Form. • To obtain the page IDs of Instant Forms within your ad account, use [/page/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-page-id/v1.3) and set business_type to LEAD_GEN. • To create an Instant Form, use [Instant Page Editor SDK](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/instant-page-editor-sdk/v1.3) and set businessType to 1.
landing_page_url_listNot specified
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Người dùng ủy quyền (Authorized User) • Người dùng TikTok (TikTok User) • Tài khoản TikTok trong Business Center | `identity_type` | Một trong các giá trị: `AUTH_CODE`, `TT_USER`, `BC_AUTH_TT`. **Lưu ý**: Đối với danh tính Spark Ads, chỉ định giá trị cho `identity_type` và `identity_id` bên trong đối tượng `creative_info`. |
identity_idSpecify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Creative assets · Ad creatives & Ad textFor a single ad, you can include one to **50 ad creatives** that can consist of the following types: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about the combination of available ad creatives based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3).ad_formatSpecify a valid value
| `creative_list`, `video_info`, `image_info`, `music_info`, `ad_text_list`, `tiktok_item_id` | Chỉ định từ 1 đến 50 tài liệu sáng tạo qua `creative_list` (Video, Bài đăng video TikTok, Bài đăng ảnh TikTok, Thẻ xoay vòng). Xem chi tiết tại [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3). | - | - |
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Ảnh bìa video (Thumbnail) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Ảnh bìa thông minh • Thủ công | `thumbnail_mode` | Khi `video_info` được chỉ định, dùng: `AUTOMATIC` hoặc `MANUAL` |
Text and add-ons · Call to action textDynamiccall_to_action_id Specify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Text and add-ons · Featured product *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledproduct_titles product_image_list selling_pointsSpecify valid values or not specified
Text and add-ons · Interactive add-ons *(Không bắt buộc)* (When the ad creatives include videos or video posts )Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to one add-on of the following type: • Display Cardinteractive_add_on_listNot specified or specify up to one ID of the following add-on type: • Display Card **Note**: You can only use add-ons when creative_list contains video creatives, including videos and TikTok video posts. To create an interactive add-on (creative portfolio), use [/creative/portfolio/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-portfolio/v1.3). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Display Card portfolio, see [Cards](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/cards/v1.3#anchor-1-1).
Text and add-ons · Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disableddisclaimerSpecify a valid value or not specified
Automatic enhancementsDisabled or enabled with any of the following types: • Translate and dub • Video quality • Music refresh • Image quality • Resizecreative_auto_enhancement_strategy_listNot specified or specify any of the following values: • TRANSLATE_AND_DUB • MUSIC_REFRESH • VIDEO_QUALITY • IMAGE_QUALITY • IMAGE_RESIZE
Tracking · TikTok events tracking · Website *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledtracking_pixel_idSpecify a valid value or not specified
Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledtracking_app_idSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledimpression_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledclick_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party integrations · Track viewability with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.viewability_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
viewability_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when viewability_postbid_partner is IAS **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS,brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.
Tracking · Third-party integrations · Measure brand safety with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.brand_safety_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: If you configure brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields as IAS, you need to specify both as IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
brand_safety_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when brand_safety_postbid_partner is IAS **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS,brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
