|---|---|---|---|

| Tên nhóm quảng cáo (Ad group name) | Chỉ định một tên hợp lệ | `adgroup_name` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ |
CatalogSpecify **an Auto-Model catalog with at least one approved product**catalog_id catalog_authorized_bc_idSpecify valid values. The Auto-Model catalog (catalog_id) needs to have at least one approved product. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-overview-of-a-catalog/v1.3), which should be at least 1. To learn about how to create an Auto-Model catalog, see [Prerequisite](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-automotive-search-ads-for-models/v1.3#anchor-1).
Optimization and bidding · GoalAny of the following types: • Click • Show your ads to people that are most likely to click on them. • Conversations • Show your ads to people that are most likely to start a TikTok direct message conversation.optimization_goalAny of the following values: • CLICK • CONVERSATION **Note**: • Whenbudget_optimize_on is true at the campaign level, specify the same optimization_goalfor ad groups within the same campaign. • If optimization_goal is CONVERSATION, omit optimization_event or set optimization_event to MESSAGE.
Optimization and bidding · Optimization locationTikTok direct messages: Collect and connect with leads through TikTok direct messagespromotion_typeLEAD_GEN_CLICK_TO_TT_DIRECT_MESSAGE
| `promotion_target_type` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Optimization and bidding · Bid Strategy and *(Không bắt buộc)* Target CPAThe bid strategy can be any of the following: • Maximum Delivery. • Cost Cap. You need to specify a Target CPA at the same time.bid_type bid_price conversion_bid_priceSet bid_type to BID_TYPE_CUSTOM or BID_TYPE_NO_BID. • If optimization_goal is CLICK and bid_type is BID_TYPE_CUSTOM, specify bid_price at the same time. • If optimization_goal is CONVERSATION and bid_type is BID_TYPE_CUSTOM, specify conversion_bid_price at the same time.
deep_bid_type roas_bidNot specified
Optimization and bidding · Billing event • If optimization goal is Click, the billing event should be CPC. • If optimization goal is Conversations, the billing event should be oCPM.billing_event • If optimization_goal is CLICK, set this field to CPC. • If optimization_goal is CONVERSATION, set this field to OCPM.
| Loại phân phối (Delivery Type) | Tiêu chuẩn (Mặc định) | N/A | Theo mặc định, loại phân phối cho nhóm quảng cáo Upgraded Smart+ là Tiêu chuẩn (Standard). |
| Từ khóa tìm kiếm · Từ khóa (Keywords) | **Chỉ định danh sách 1 đến 1.000 từ khóa tìm kiếm hợp lệ** | `keyword`, `match_type` | Chỉ định danh sách từ khóa hợp lệ cùng kiểu đối sánh qua `keyword` và `match_type`. Xem đề xuất qua endpoint `/tool/search_keyword/recommend/`, khám phá từ khóa qua `/tool/search_keyword/keyword_idea/`, và kiểm tra trạng thái duyệt qua `/smart_plus/adgroup/get/`. |
| Từ khóa tự động (Automated keywords) | Bật hoặc tắt | `automated_keywords_enabled` | `true` hoặc `false` (hoặc không truyền) |
| Từ khóa phủ định (Negative keywords) | Áp dụng từ khóa phủ định cấp tài khoản | N/A | Áp dụng từ khóa phủ định cấp tài khoản. Để quản lý từ khóa phủ định, sử dụng các endpoint Từ khóa phủ định. |
| Ngân sách và lịch trình · Ngân sách | Khi chọn chiến lược ngân sách nhóm quảng cáo: Có thể đặt chế độ Trọn đời hoặc Hàng ngày | `budget_mode`, `budget` | Khi `budget_optimize_on` là `false` ở cấp chiến dịch, thiết lập `budget_mode` thành `BUDGET_MODE_DYNAMIC_DAILY_BUDGET` hoặc `BUDGET_MODE_TOTAL` và truyền giá trị ngân sách qua `budget`. |
| Ngân sách và lịch trình · Lịch trình | Một trong các loại: • Chạy liên tục từ thời điểm bắt đầu • Chạy trong khoảng thời gian xác định | `schedule_type`, `schedule_start_time`, `schedule_end_time` | • Để chạy liên tục: Đặt `schedule_type` là `SCHEDULE_FROM_NOW` và truyền `schedule_start_time`. • Để chạy có thời hạn: Đặt `schedule_type` là `SCHEDULE_START_END` và truyền cả `schedule_start_time` và `schedule_end_time`. |
| Ngân sách và lịch trình · Phân bổ theo khung giờ *(Không bắt buộc)* | Một trong các loại: • Cả ngày (Mặc định) • Chọn thời gian cụ thể | `dayparting` | Một trong các cấu hình: • Chuỗi toàn 1 (hoặc không chỉ định) • Chuỗi chứa ký tự 0 biểu thị không phân phối |
| Chế độ tối ưu hóa nhắm mục tiêu đối tượng | **Nhắm mục tiêu tùy chỉnh (Custom targeting)**: Kiểm soát chính xác đối tượng xem quảng cáo của bạn. | `targeting_optimization_mode` | `MANUAL`. Xem chi tiết cài đặt nhắm mục tiêu được hỗ trợ tại [Available targeting settings for Upgraded Smart+ Lead Generation Search Ads Campaigns](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-an-upgraded-smart-lead-generation-search-ads-campaign-with-optimization-location-as-instant-form/v1.3#anchor-2-2-1). |
| Vị trí hiển thị (Placement) | Kết quả tìm kiếm TikTok | `placement_type` | `PLACEMENT_TYPE_NORMAL` |
| `placements` | `["PLACEMENT_TIKTOK"]` | - | - |
Placements and brand safety · Brand safety and suitability · Inventory filter and Category exclusions *(Không bắt buộc)*Any previous account-level settings in the brand safety hub will apply to your campaign.N/AIf these parameters are not specified, the ad account-level brand safety and suitability settings in the brand safety hub will apply to your campaign. • To retrieve the ad account-level brand safety and suitability settings in the brand safety hub, use [/tiktok_inventory_filters/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-brand-safety-hub-settings-of-an-ad-account/v1.3). • To configure or update the ad account-level brand safety and suitability settings in the brand safety hub, use [/tiktok_inventory_filters/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/set-or-update-the-brand-safety-hub-settings-of-an-ad-account/v1.3).
| Cho phép bình luận | Bật hoặc tắt | `comment_disabled` | Chỉ định các giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định |
| Cho phép tải xuống video | Bật hoặc tắt | `share_disabled` | Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định |
| Cho phép chia sẻ video | Bật hoặc tắt | `video_download_disabled` | Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định |
| Cho phép chia sẻ video | Bật hoặc tắt | `video_download_disabled` | Chỉ định giá trị hợp lệ hoặc không chỉ định |
| Danh sách chặn Pangle | Tắt (Disabled) | N/A | N/A |

#### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/adgroup/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'haapi-v2: 1' \
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "campaign_id": "{{campaign_id}}",
    "request_id": "{{request_id}}",
    "adgroup_name": "{{adgroup_name}}",
    "promotion_type": "LEAD_GENERATION",
    "promotion_target_type": "EXTERNAL_WEBSITE",
    "catalog_id": "{{catalog_id}}",
    "catalog_authorized_bc_id": "{{catalog_authorized_bc_id}}",
    "optimization_goal": "CLICK",
    "bid_type": "BID_TYPE_NO_BID",
    "billing_event": "CPC",
    "search_keywords": [
        {
            "keyword": "{{keyword}}",
            "match_type": "BROAD_WORD"
        },
        {
            "keyword": "{{keyword}}",
            "match_type": "BROAD_WORD"
        }
    ],
    "automated_keywords_enabled": true,
    "budget_mode": "BUDGET_MODE_DYNAMIC_DAILY_BUDGET",
    "budget": {{budget}},
    "schedule_type": "SCHEDULE_START_END",
    "schedule_start_time": "{{schedule_start_time}}",
    "schedule_end_time": "{{schedule_end_time}}",
    "targeting_optimization_mode": "MANUAL",
    "targeting_spec": {
        "location_ids": [
            "{{location_ids}}"
        ]
    },
    "placement_type": "PLACEMENT_TYPE_NORMAL",
    "placements": [
        "PLACEMENT_TIKTOK"
    ]
}'
```
Phản hồi (Response)
```http
// curl
{
    "code": 0,
    "message": "OK",
    "request_id": "{{request_id}}",
    "data": {
        "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
        "adgroup_name": "{{adgroup_name}}",
        "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
        "app_config": [],
        "automated_keywords_enabled": true,
        "bid_type": "BID_TYPE_NO_BID",
        "billing_event": "CPC",
        "budget": {{budget}},
        "budget_mode": "BUDGET_MODE_DYNAMIC_DAILY_BUDGET",
        "campaign_id": "{{campaign_id}}",
        "campaign_name": "{{campaign_name}}",
        "catalog_authorized_bc_id": "{{catalog_authorized_bc_id}}",
        "catalog_id": "{{catalog_id}}",
        "comment_disabled": false,
        "conversion_bid_price": 0,
        "create_time": "{{create_time}}",
        "dayparting": "",
        "is_hfss": false,
        "is_lhf_compliance": false,
        "min_budget": 0,
        "modify_time": "{{modify_time}}",
        "operation_status": "ENABLE",
        "optimization_goal": "CLICK",
        "pacing": "PACING_MODE_SMOOTH",
        "phone_info": {},
        "placement_type": "PLACEMENT_TYPE_NORMAL",
        "placements": [
            "PLACEMENT_TIKTOK"
        ],
        "promotion_target_type": "EXTERNAL_WEBSITE",
        "promotion_type": "LEAD_GENERATION",
        "schedule_end_time": "{{schedule_end_time}}",
        "schedule_start_time": "{{schedule_start_time}}",
        "schedule_type": "SCHEDULE_START_END",
        "search_keywords": [
            {
                "audit_status": "AUDITING",
                "keyword": "{{keyword}}",
                "match_type": "BROAD_WORD"
            },
            {
                "audit_status": "AUDITING",
                "keyword": "{{keyword}}",
                "match_type": "BROAD_WORD"
            }
        ],
        "search_result_enabled": false,
        "secondary_status": "ADGROUP_STATUS_CREATE",
        "share_disabled": false,
        "suggestion_audience_enabled": false,
        "targeting_optimization_mode": "MANUAL",
        "targeting_spec": {
            "actions": [],
            "brand_safety_type": "EXPANDED_INVENTORY",
            "excluded_custom_actions": [],
            "gender": "GENDER_UNLIMITED",
            "included_custom_actions": [],
            "location_ids": [
                "{{location_ids}}"
            ],
            "smart_audience_enabled": false,
            "smart_interest_behavior_enabled": false,
            "spending_power": "ALL"
        },
        "video_download_disabled": false
    }
}
```

### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

### Khi vị trí tối ưu hóa là Trang web or Instant Form

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
Product source details · ProductsMột trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)product_specific_type product_set_id product_idsSet product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each Auto-Model product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3).
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Người dùng ủy quyền (Authorized User) • Người dùng TikTok (TikTok User) • Tài khoản TikTok trong Business Center | `identity_type` | Một trong các giá trị: `AUTH_CODE`, `TT_USER`, `BC_AUTH_TT`. **Lưu ý**: Đối với danh tính Spark Ads, chỉ định giá trị cho `identity_type` và `identity_id` bên trong đối tượng `creative_info`. |
identity_idSpecify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Destination • When at the ad group level, Optimization Location is Website: • **Website URL**: Your own URL to direct users to browse inventory on your website. • When at the ad group level, Optimization Location is Instant Form: • **Instant Form**: An Instant Form that opens instantly when someone interacts with your ad.landing_page_url_list page_list • When at the ad group level promotion_target_type is EXTERNAL_WEBSITE: • Specify your own URL via landing_page_url_list. • Do not specify page_list. • When at the ad group level promotion_target_type is INSTANT_PAGE: • Specify the ID of an Instant Form through page_list. • To obtain the ID of an Instant Form, set business_type to LEAD_GEN in [/page/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-page-id/v1.3). • To create an Instant Form, use [Instant Page Editor SDK](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/instant-page-editor-sdk/v1.3) and set businessType to 1. • Do not specify landing_page_url_list.
UTM parameters (Optional for Website URL)Enabled or disabledutm_paramsWhenlanding_page_url_list is specified: • Specify valid values or not specified. If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.
Creative assets · Automatically select from catalogAny of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Search Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-automotive-search-ads-for-inventory/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1-1). • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products.The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • When using a non-Spark Ad identity: • Specify 1-50 videos with cover images • Specify 1-5 ad texts • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list ad_format • To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify an end card image via image_info and a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Automotive Search Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-automotive-search-ads-for-inventory/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1-1). • When catalog_creative_toggle is true, both image_info and music_info are required. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false, and specify the following: • one to 50 videos (video_info) with cover images (image_info) and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list). • set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO
tiktok_item_idNot specified
Creative assets · Call to action textEnabled with a standard call to actioncall_to_action_idSpecify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Creative assets · Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)* • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following options: • Emission disclaimer • Discount or offer disclaimer • **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission disclaimer • emission disclaimer URL • emission overlay disclaimer • emission image • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer disclaimer • offer disclaimer URL • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabledauto_disclaimer_types • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following values: • EMISSION • DISCOUNT • **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission_disclaimer • emission_disclaimer_url • emission_overlay_disclaimer • emission_image_link • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer_disclaimer • offer_disclaimer_url • To get the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3). To update the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/update-products/v1.3). • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified
Ad enhancements · End card • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled. Select the last photo to appear in the carousel to encourage people to browse your full inventory. • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabledimage_info • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Specify one end card. The end card will be displayed at the end of the carousel. • To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-an-image-reference/v1.3) or [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3). • The image should meet the following requirements at the same time: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3) for the image is true. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified
Tracking · TikTok events tracking · Website (Optional when Optimization Location is Instant Form)Enabled or disabledtracking_pixel_idWhen promotion_target_type is INSTANT_PAGE at the ad group level: Specify a valid value or not specified
Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledtracking_app_idSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledimpression_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledclick_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party integrations · Track viewability with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.viewability_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
viewability_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when viewability_postbid_partner is IAS **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS,brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.
Tracking · Third-party integrations · Measure brand safety with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.brand_safety_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: If you configure brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields as IAS, you need to specify both as IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
brand_safety_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when brand_safety_postbid_partner is IAS **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS,brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

### Khi vị trí tối ưu hóa là Tin nhắn trực tiếp TikTok

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
Product source details · ProductsMột trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)product_specific_type product_set_id product_idsSet product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each Auto-Inventory or Auto-Model product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3).
Identity · Select a TikTok accountSelect a valid TikTok accountidentity_typeAny of the following values: • TT_USER • BC_AUTH_TT If you want to use an identity in TikTok Direct Messaging Ads, you need to have direct message permission for the identity. To confirm this, call [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3) or [/identity/info/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-info-about-an-identity/v1.3) and check Liệu returned can_manage_message is true. • If the returned can_manage_message is false and identity_type is TT_USER, you can navigate to [the ad account user setting page](https://ads.tiktok.com/ac/page/settings). In the **Profile** section of the **Personal Info** tab, click **Edit access** to edit your permissions for the associated TikTok account. Ensure that you have **"Read and manage messages in your inbox"** permission for the TikTok account. • If the returned can_manage_message is false and identity_type is BC_AUTH_TT, you can ask the Business Center admin to grant you direct message permission for the TikTok account associated with the identity by using [/bc/asset/assign/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/assign-an-asset/v1.3). Set asset_type to TT_ACCOUNT and ensure that the tt_account_roles value includes at least POST and DIRECT_MESSAGE.
identity_idSpecify a valid value. To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
DestinationTikTok direct messagepage_list landing_page_url_listNot specified
Message template (Welcome message)Enabled Greet people with an automatic message sent by your TikTok account after they start a direct message conversation from one of your ads.auto_message_listSpecify a valid value. • To obtain a list of welcome messages within your ad account, use [/creative/auto_message/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-welcome-messages-within-an-ad-account/v1.3). • To create a welcome message within your ad account, use [/creative/auto_message/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-welcome-message-within-an-ad-account/v1.3).
Creative assets · Automatically select from catalogAny of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations for Upgraded Smart+ TikTok Direct Messaging Search Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-automotive-search-ads-for-inventory/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1-1). • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • For Spark Ads Pull, specify video posts. • For Spark Ads Push, specify videos with cover images. • Specify 1-5 ad texts • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential. catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list ad_format • To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify an end card image via image_info and a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see [Customize the ad format combinations for Upgraded Smart+ TikTok Direct Messaging Search Ads](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-upgraded-smart-automotive-search-ads-for-inventory/v1.3#anchor-2-3-1-1). • When catalog_creative_toggle is true, both image_info and music_info are required. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false: • Set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list) • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • To create Spark Ads by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify video posts through tiktok_item_id • To create Spark Ads by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify one to 50 videos through video_info with cover images through image_info
Creative assets · Call to action textSend message| `call_to_action_id` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
call_to_action_list[{"call_to_action": "SEND_MESSAGE"}]
Creative assets · Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)* • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is enabled: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following options: • Emission disclaimer • Discount or offer disclaimer • **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission disclaimer • emission disclaimer URL • emission overlay disclaimer • emission image • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer disclaimer • offer disclaimer URL • When the "Automatically select from catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabledauto_disclaimer_types • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with any of the following values: • EMISSION • DISCOUNT • **Note**: Before using any type of disclaimer, ensure that you have specified the necessary disclaimer details for each vehicle in the Auto-Model catalog. • To use the emission disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • emission_disclaimer • emission_disclaimer_url • emission_overlay_disclaimer • emission_image_link • To use the discount or offer disclaimer, ensure that you have provided the following details for each vehicle: • offer_disclaimer • offer_disclaimer_url • To get the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3). To update the attributes of vehicles in an Auto-Model catalog, use [/catalog/product/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/update-products/v1.3). • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified
Carousel enhancements · End card • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is enabled: • Enabled. Select the last photo to appear in the carousel to encourage people to browse your full inventory. • When the "Create catalog carousel from your catalog" setting is disabled: • Disabledimage_info • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to true: • Specify one end card. The end card will be displayed at the end of the carousel. • To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-an-image-reference/v1.3) or [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3). • The image should meet the following requirements at the same time: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3) for the image is true. • When catalog_creative_toggle is set to false: • Not specified
