<!-- doc_id: 1875743103825537 -->
# Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm bán hàng Upgraded Smart+ (`Create an Upgraded Smart+ Sales Search Ads Campaign`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm bán hàng Upgraded Smart+
This article explains how to create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign using the Sales objective.

Depending on where you want to drive your sales traffic (your conversion destination), you can route users to a website, an app, or both. For detailed instructions on configuring these specific routing destinations, refer to the following guides:

- To route sales traffic to a website, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign for Web](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743211659265).
- To route sales traffic to an app, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Catalog Search Ads Campaign for App](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743215419394).
- To route sales traffic to both a website and an app, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign for Website and App](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743219104321).

---

<a id="doc-1875743211659265"></a>
<!-- doc_id: 1875743211659265 -->
<!-- doc_id: 1875743211659265 -->
# Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ cho Web (`Create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign for Web`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm bán hàng Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ cho Web
This article explains how to create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign that uses the Sales objective along with a website conversion destination.

- To configure a web campaign without a product catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Non-Catalog Search Ads Campaign for Web](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743288255489).
- To configure a web campaign powered by an E-commerce catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ E-commerce Search Ads Campaign for Web](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743291988242).
- To configure a web campaign powered by a travel catalog (hotel, flight, or destination), see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Travel Search Ads Campaign for Web](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743295409170).
- To configure a web campaign powered by an entertainment catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Streaming Search Ads Campaign for Web](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743331398673).

