### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
Destination URLEnabledlanding_page_url_listProvide one URL of the landing page or website you want to promote. The link should match the data connection you specified in the ad group.
page_listNot specified
UTM parameters *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledutm_paramsSpecify valid values or not specified. If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Người dùng ủy quyền (Authorized User) • Người dùng TikTok (TikTok User) • Tài khoản TikTok trong Business Center | `identity_type` | Một trong các giá trị: `AUTH_CODE`, `TT_USER`, `BC_AUTH_TT`. **Lưu ý**: Đối với danh tính Spark Ads, chỉ định giá trị cho `identity_type` và `identity_id` bên trong đối tượng `creative_info`. |
identity_idSpecify a valid value. To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Creative assets · Ad creatives & Ad textFor a single ad, you can include one to **50 ad creatives** that can consist of the following types: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel To learn about the combination of available ad creatives based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3).ad_formatSpecify a valid value
| `creative_list`, `video_info`, `image_info`, `music_info`, `ad_text_list`, `tiktok_item_id` | Chỉ định từ 1 đến 50 tài liệu sáng tạo qua `creative_list` (Video, Bài đăng video TikTok, Bài đăng ảnh TikTok, Thẻ xoay vòng). Xem chi tiết tại [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3). | - | - |
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Ảnh bìa video (Thumbnail) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Ảnh bìa thông minh • Thủ công | `thumbnail_mode` | Khi `video_info` được chỉ định, dùng: `AUTOMATIC` hoặc `MANUAL` |
Add product information *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledproduct_infoSpecify a valid value or not specified. To learn about the specific parameters within this field that you can use for the scenario, see [Available product information settings in Upgraded Smart+ Campaigns](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/available-product-information-settings-in-upgraded-smart-campaigns/v1.3).
Call to actionDynamiccall_to_action_idSpecify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disableddisclaimerSpecify a valid value or not specified
Interactive add-ons *(Không bắt buộc)* (When the ad creatives include videos or video posts)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to one add-on in the following type: • Display Cardinteractive_add_on_listNot specified or specify up to one ID of the following add-on type: • Display Card **Note**: • You can only use add-ons when creative_list contains video creatives, including videos and TikTok video posts. To create an interactive add-on (creative portfolio), use [/creative/portfolio/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-portfolio/v1.3). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Display Card portfolio, see [Cards](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/cards/v1.3#anchor-1-1).
Automatic enhancementsDisabled or enabled with any of the following types: • Translate and dub • Video quality • Music refresh • Image quality • Resizecreative_auto_enhancement_strategy_listNot specified or specify any of the following values: • TRANSLATE_AND_DUB • MUSIC_REFRESH • VIDEO_QUALITY • IMAGE_QUALITY • IMAGE_RESIZE
Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledtracking_app_idSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledimpression_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledclick_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Track viewability with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.viewability_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
viewability_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when viewability_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Measure brand safety with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.brand_safety_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to specify both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
brand_safety_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when brand_safety_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
