### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
Product source details · ProductsMột trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)product_specific_type product_set_id product_idsSet product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available E-commerce catalog products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each E-commerce catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3). **Note**: To determine Liệu an E-commerce catalog product is available for use in ads, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3). If the returned ad_creation_eligible for the product is AVAILABLE, you can use the product in ads.
Destination URLEnabledlanding_page_url_listSpecify a valid URL. Users will be directed to your product links, TikTok Instant Page, or the specified link depending on where they’re most likely to convert.
page_listNot specified
UTM parameters *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledutm_paramsSpecify valid values or not specified If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Danh tính (Identity) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Người dùng ủy quyền (Authorized User) • Người dùng TikTok (TikTok User) • Tài khoản TikTok trong Business Center | `identity_type` | Một trong các giá trị: `AUTH_CODE`, `TT_USER`, `BC_AUTH_TT`. **Lưu ý**: Đối với danh tính Spark Ads, chỉ định giá trị cho `identity_type` và `identity_id` bên trong đối tượng `creative_info`. |
identity_idSpecify a valid value To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Creative assets · Autoselect from catalogAny of the following options: • Enabled (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ E-commerce Search Ads Campaigns for Web. • Disabled • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products.The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • For a single ad, you can include one to **50 ad creatives** that can consist of the following types: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel • To learn about the combination of available ad creatives based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3). • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list tiktok_item_id ad_format • To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ E-commerce Search Ads Campaigns for Web. • **Note**: music_info is Bắt buộc khi catalog_creative_toggle is true. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false, and specify one to 50 ad creatives through creative_list. The ad creatives can be any of the following: • Videos • TikTok video posts • TikTok photo posts • Carousel • To learn about configurations of the available ad creative combinations based on identity type, see [Ad creative combinations by identity and ad type](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upgraded-smart-ad-creative-combinations-by-identity-and-ad-type/v1.3).
Creative assets · Catalog creative settingsDisabled or enabled with one to three of the following types: • **Video** • **Image** • **Video templates**catalog_creative_toggle catalog_media_settings • To disable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Leave catalog_media_settings unspecified. • To enable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to true. • Provide one to three of the following values in catalog_media_settings: • VIDEO • IMAGE • TEMPLATE_VIDEO
When you enable **Video templates,** select one of the following video template settings: • All video templates and video URLs • A specific video templatecatalog_template_video_idWhen TEMPLATE_VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value: • To select the "All video templates and video URLs" option, leave this field unspecified. • To select a specific video template, specify a valid value.
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Ảnh bìa video (Thumbnail) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Ảnh bìa thông minh • Thủ công | `thumbnail_mode` | Khi `video_info` được chỉ định, dùng: `AUTOMATIC` hoặc `MANUAL` |
Call to actionDynamiccall_to_action_idSpecify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disableddisclaimerSpecify a valid value or not specified
Interactive add-ons *(Không bắt buộc)* (When the ad creatives include videos or video posts)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to one add-on in the following type: • Display Card **Note**: By using interactive add-ons, your ad will no longer display product cards.interactive_add_on_listNot specified or specify up to one ID in the following add-on type: • Display Card **Note**:  • You can only use add-ons when creative_list contains video creatives, including videos and TikTok video posts. • To create an interactive add-on (creative portfolio), use [/creative/portfolio/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-portfolio/v1.3). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Display Card portfolio, see [Cards](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/cards/v1.3#anchor-1-1). • By using interactive add-ons, your ad will no longer display product cards.
Theo dõi · Theo dõi sự kiện TikTok · Sự kiện ứng dụng *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledtracking_app_idSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledimpression_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledclick_tracking_urlSpecify a valid value or not specified
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Track viewability with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.viewability_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
viewability_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when viewability_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.
Tracking · Third-party tracking settings · Measure brand safety with third-party partner *(Không bắt buộc)*Disable or enabled with any of the following partners: • DoubleVerify • IAS with IAS wrapped tag • Zefr **Note**: When you configure both the "Track viewability with third-party partner" and "Measure brand safety with third-party partner" settings: • If you set either of these two settings to IAS, you need to set both to IAS, and specify the same IAS wrapped tag. • If you set either of these two settings to Zefr, you need to set both to Zefr.brand_safety_postbid_partnerNot specified or specify any of the following values: • DOUBLE_VERIFY • IAS • ZEFR **Note**: When you configure brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner: • If you set either of these two fields to IAS, you need to specify both to IAS, and assign the same value (the wrapped VAST URL that you obtain from the measurement partner IAS) to brand_safety_vast_url and viewability_vast_url. • If you set either of these two fields to ZEFR, you need to set both to ZEFR.
brand_safety_vast_urlSpecify a valid value when brand_safety_postbid_partner is IAS. **Note**: If you set both brand_safety_postbid_partner and viewability_postbid_partner to IAS, brand_safety_vast_url should be the same as viewability_vast_url.

### Tùy chỉnh kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo trong Chiến dịch tìm kiếm thương mại điện tử trên web Upgraded Smart+

If you enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (`catalog_creative_toggle` is `true`), the system will automatically create ads using combinations of three possible formats: catalog carousel, catalog video, single video, and image carousel.

The possible ad format combinations for your E-commerce Search Ads Campaigns for Web are illustrated in the following table.

| Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục có sẵn? | Video danh mục có sẵn? | Video đơn có sẵn? | Thẻ xoay vòng ảnh có sẵn? | Kết hợp định dạng cho Chiến dịch tìm kiếm thương mại điện tử trên web |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | Catalog carousel only |
| ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ❌ | Catalog carousel and single video |
| ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ✅ | Catalog carousel and image carousel |
| ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | Catalog carousel and catalog video |
| ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | Catalog carousel, catalog video, and single video |
| ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | Catalog carousel, catalog video, and image carousel |
| ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | ✅ | Catalog carousel, single video, and image carousel |
| ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Catalog carousel, catalog video, single video, and image carousel |

To ensure certain ad formats are available in E-commerce Search Ads Campaigns for Web, follow the instructions in the following table.

Ad formatAd format descriptionHow to ensure the ad format is availableHow to configure the parameters

catalog carouselDisplay 2–20 products in a slideshow format. This format will showcase product images of up to 20 products from your catalog at a time.Enable "Image" in your catalog creative settings, allowing the system to use images from your catalogs in the ad.Ensure IMAGE is included in the catalog_media_settings value.
The catalog needs to contain at least two products supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Ensure that the catalog (catalog_id) contains at least two approved products. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-overview-of-a-catalog/v1.3), which should be at least two. • Carousel image selection scope: The product images for products in a catalog (catalog_id) will be dynamically chosen as images in the delivering Catalog Carousel Ads. The scope of product images to choose from is determined by the specified product_specific_type parameter: • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from all products in the catalog. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from products in the specified product set (product_set_id). • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from a customized product range consisting of up to 20 products (product_ids). • Carousel image type: • Use the main images of the products: By default, the main image URLs of the dynamically selected catalog products will be used as Carousel images.
Specify a piece of music supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Pass one music ID that is valid for use in Catalog Carousel Ads via music_info. **Note**: To obtain a valid music ID, you can use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Catalog Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL in [/file/music/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-music-list/v1.3). • Upload a piece of customized music for Catalog Carousel Ads to an ad account by using any of the following methods: • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL and pass music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3). • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL, upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and pass file_id to [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3).
catalog videoGenerate a dynamic video based on information from the product catalogEnable "Video templates" in your catalog creative settings, allowing the system to use video templates from your catalogs in the ad.Ensure TEMPLATE_VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value.
The catalog must have at least one video template. • If you select a video template, the video template will be used to automatically generate the catalog video for each catalog product. • If you don't select the video template, the system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video.Ensure that at least one video template is bound to your catalog (catalog_id). • To ensure that at least one video template (video package) is bound to your catalog, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • To learn about how to create video templates on TikTok Ads Manager, see [How to create video packages in a Catalog](https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/how-to-create-video-packages-in-a-catalog). • To retrieve video templates for your catalog via API, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • If catalog_template_video_id is specified, the specified video template will be used to automatically generate the catalog video for each catalog product. • If catalog_template_video_id is not specified, the system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video. When a product has a video URL, that video will be used instead.
Use videos from your catalog to promote your products.Enable "Video" in your catalog creative settings, allowing the system to use videos from your catalogs in the ad.Ensure VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value.
You need to configure a video URL for each catalog product.Ensure that a video URL (video_url) has been configured for each catalog product. • To ensure a video URL has been configured for each catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3) and check the returned video_url. • If you want to add video URLs for your catalog products, use [/catalog/product/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/update-products/v1.3).
single videoUse specified video creatives to promote your products.Specify additional videos or TikTok video postsSpecify individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both. • For Spark Ads created by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify additional TikTok video posts via tiktok_item_id. • For Spark Ads created by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify additional videos via video_info and cover images via image_info, and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list).
image carouselUse specified carousel creatives to promote your products.Specify additional carousels or TikTok photo postsSpecify individual carousels, photo posts, or a combination of both. • For Spark Ads created by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify additional TikTok photo posts via tiktok_item_id. • For Spark Ads created by pushing carousels to the TikTok account, specify one to 35 image IDs via image_info and one valid music ID via music_id, and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list) in each carousel. • To get image IDs, use [/file/image/ad/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-an-image-reference/v1.3) or [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3). • The image to be used in Carousel Ads should meet the requirements below **at the same time**: • Specifications: • File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. • Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. • Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. • File Size: below 50 MB. • The value of the parameter is_carousel_usable returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/search-for-images/v1.3) for the image is true. • To obtain a valid music ID, use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CAROUSEL_ADS in [/file/music/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-music-list/v1.3). • Upload a piece of customized music for Carousel Ads to an ad account by any of the following methods: • Specifying music_scene as CAROUSEL_ADS and passing music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3) • Specifying music_scene as CAROUSEL_ADS , specifying upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and passing file_id in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3).

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
    "landing_page_url_list": [
        {
            "landing_page_url": "{{landing_page_url}}"
        }
    ],
    "creative_list": [
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "CATALOG_CAROUSEL",
                "music_info": {
                    "music_id": "{{music_id}}"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
                "video_info": {
                    "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                },
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{web_uri}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "ad_text_list": [
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        }
    ],
    "ad_configuration": {
        "product_specific_type": "ALL",
        "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT",
        "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
        "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
        "catalog_creative_toggle": true,
        "catalog_creative_info": {
            "catalog_media_settings": [
                "IMAGE",
                "VIDEO",
                "TEMPLATE_VIDEO"
            ]
        },
        "call_to_action_id": "{{call_to_action_id}}"
    }
}'
```
