# Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm danh mục Upgraded Smart+ cho Ứng dụng (`Create an Upgraded Smart+ Catalog Search Ads Campaign for App`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo chiến dịch Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch quảng cáo tìm kiếm Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm bán hàng Upgraded Smart+ > Tạo chiến dịch tìm kiếm danh mục Upgraded Smart+ cho Ứng dụng
This article explains how to create an Upgraded Smart+ Search Ads Campaign using the Sales objective and the app sales destination.

Depending on your catalog preference, you can create E-commerce, Travel, or Streaming Catalog Campaigns for your app.

- To create a campaign using an E-commerce catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ E-commerce Search Ads Campaign for App](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743384633345).
- To create a campaign using a travel (hotel, flight, or destination) catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Travel Search Ads Campaign for App](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743388430337).
- To create a campaign using an entertainment catalog, see [Create an Upgraded Smart+ Streaming Search Ads Campaign for App](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1875743392271362).

