### Bước 3: Tạo mẫu quảng cáo (Create an ad)
Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522). Lưu ý rằng các yêu cầu cấu hình sau đây phải được đáp ứng. Để xem danh sách đầy đủ tất cả các tham số, xem [/smart_plus/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/62-upgraded-smartplus-p5.md#doc-1843317390059522).

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|

| Tên quảng cáo *(Không bắt buộc)* | Mặc định hệ thống tự tạo tên quảng cáo. Có thể tùy chỉnh bằng tên hợp lệ | `ad_name` | • Để hệ thống tự tạo, đặt trường này là "" (chuỗi rỗng). • Để tùy chỉnh tên, chỉ định chuỗi không rỗng. |
Product source details · ProductsMột trong các tùy chọn: • Tất cả sản phẩm • Bộ sản phẩm (Product set) • Sản phẩm cụ thể (tối đa 20 sản phẩm)product_specific_type product_set_id product_idsSet product_specific_type to ALL, PRODUCT_SET or CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS. • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, you don't need to specify product_set_id and product_ids. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, you need to specify product_set_id. product_ids is not needed. • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, you need to specify a maximum of 20 available catalog products through product_ids. product_set_id is not needed. • To retrieve the product ID (product_id) of each catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3).
Website URLEnabledlanding_page_url_listSpecify a landing page
deeplink deeplink_type fallback_type page_listNot specified
Added URL parameters *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disabledutm_paramsSpecify valid values or not specified. **Note**: If you set landing_page_url_list to a URL that already includes URL parameters, you can optionally specify utm_params at the same time to store the URL parameters used in the URL. In such cases, you need to ensure that utm_params exactly matches the used URL parameters. The URL parameters will not be automatically appended to the landing_page_url_list upon ad delivery.
Creative assets · IdentityAny of the following options: • Authorized User • TikTok User • TikTok Account User in Business Centeridentity_typeAny of the following values: • AUTH_CODE • TT_USER • BC_AUTH_TT **Note**: • For Spark Ads identities (AUTH_CODE,TT_USER,BC_AUTH_TT), specify values to identity_type and identity_id within the creative_info object.
identity_idSpecify a valid value. To get the list of identities under your ad account, use [/identity/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-identity-list/v1.3).
| `identity_authorized_bc_id` | Chỉ định một giá trị hợp lệ khi `identity_type` là `BC_AUTH_TT` | - | - |
Creative assets · Autoselect from catalogAny of the following options: • **Enabled** (Recommended) • Images and videos in your catalog will be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. • Multiple ad format combinations are supported. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Catalog Search Ads Campaigns for Website and App. • **Disabled** • Images and videos in your catalog will not be used to automatically generate optimized Catalog Ads in all formats for your products. The system will automatically create single video ads using your specified content. • Requirements: • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • For Spark Ads Pull, specify video posts. • For Spark Ads Push, specify videos with cover images. • Specify 1-5 ad texts • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.catalog_creative_toggle video_info image_info music_info ad_text_list tiktok_item_id ad_format • To enable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to true, specify a valid value for ad_format in each creative_info object, and specify a piece of music via music_info. For detailed configuration options and requirements, see Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Catalog Search Ads Campaigns for Website and App. • **Note**: music_info is Bắt buộc khi catalog_creative_toggle is true. • To disable auto-selection of catalog creatives, set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Set ad_format to SINGLE_VIDEO and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list) • Specify a total of 1 to 50 items, either as individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both: • To create Spark Ads by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify video posts through tiktok_item_id • To create Spark Ads by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify one to 50 videos through video_info with cover images through image_info • **Note**: Not using a catalog for creatives might restrict your ad performance potential.
Creative assets · Catalog creative settings (when an E-commerce catalog is used)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with one to three of the following types: • **Video** • **Image** • **Video templates**catalog_creative_toggle catalog_media_settings • To disable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Leave catalog_media_settings unspecified. • To enable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to true. • Provide one to three of the following values in catalog_media_settings: • VIDEO • IMAGE • TEMPLATE_VIDEO
When you enable **Video templates,** select one of the following video template settings: • All video templates and video URLs • A specific video templatecatalog_template_video_idWhen TEMPLATE_VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value: • To select the "All video templates and video URLs" option, leave this field unspecified. • To select a specific video template, specify a valid value.
Creative assets · Catalog creative settings (when a travel catalog is used)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with one to two of the following types: • **Image** • **Video templates**catalog_creative_toggle catalog_media_settings • To disable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Leave catalog_media_settings unspecified. • To enable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to true. • Provide one to two of the following values in catalog_media_settings: • IMAGE • TEMPLATE_VIDEO
When you enable **Video templates,** select one of the following video template settings: • All video templates and video URLs • A specific video templatecatalog_template_video_idWhen TEMPLATE_VIDEO is included in the catalog_media_settings value: • To select the "All video templates and video URLs" option, leave this field unspecified. • To select a specific video template, specify a valid value.
Creative assets · Catalog creative settings (when an entertainment catalog is used)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with the following type: • **Single Video**catalog_creative_toggle catalog_media_settings • To disable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to false. • Leave catalog_media_settings unspecified. • To enable catalog creative settings: • Set catalog_creative_toggle to true. • Provide the following value in catalog_media_settings: • TEMPLATE_VIDEO
| Tài sản sáng tạo · Ảnh bìa video (Thumbnail) | Một trong các tùy chọn: • Ảnh bìa thông minh • Thủ công | `thumbnail_mode` | Khi `video_info` được chỉ định, dùng: `AUTOMATIC` hoặc `MANUAL` |
Call to actionDynamiccall_to_action_idSpecify a valid value
| `call_to_action_list` | Không chỉ định (Not specified) | - | - |
Disclaimer *(Không bắt buộc)*Enabled or disableddisclaimerSpecify a valid value or not specified
Interactive add-ons (Optional when an E-commerce catalog is used and the ad creatives include videos or video posts)Tắt hoặc bật (Disabled hoặc Enabled) with up to one add-on in the following type: • Display Card **Note**: By using interactive add-ons, your ad will no longer display product cards.interactive_add_on_listNot specified or specify up to one ID in the following add-on type: • Display Card **Note**:  • You can only use add-ons when creative_list contains video creatives, including videos and TikTok video posts. • To create an interactive add-on (creative portfolio), use [/creative/portfolio/create/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/create-a-portfolio/v1.3). • To learn about how to obtain the ID of a Display Card portfolio, see [Cards](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/cards/v1.3#anchor-1-1). • By using interactive add-ons, your ad will no longer display product cards.
Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL for iOS *(Không bắt buộc)*Disabled or enabledapp_id app_type impression_tracking_urlAny of the following configurations: • Not specified • Specify valid values: • Set app_id to the App ID of an iOS app • Set app_type to APP_IOS • Set impression_tracking_url to the Impression tracking URL for iOS
Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL for iOS *(Không bắt buộc)*Disabled or enabledapp_id app_type click_tracking_urlAny of the following configurations: • Not specified • Specify valid values: • Set app_id to the App ID of an iOS app • Set app_type to APP_IOS • Set click_tracking_url to the Click tracking URL for iOS
Third-party tracking settings · Impression tracking URL for Android *(Không bắt buộc)*Disabled or enabledapp_id app_type impression_tracking_urlAny of the following configurations: • Not specified • Specify valid values: • Set app_id to the App ID of an Android app • Set app_type to APP_ANDROID • Set impression_tracking_url to the Impression tracking URL for Android
Third-party tracking settings · Click tracking URL for Android *(Không bắt buộc)*Disabled or enabledapp_id app_type click_tracking_urlAny of the following configurations: • Not specified • Specify valid values: • Set app_id to the App ID of an Android app • Set app_type to APP_ANDROID • Set click_tracking_url to the Click tracking URL for Android

### Customize the ad format combinations in Upgraded Smart+ Catalog Search Ads Campaigns for Website and App

#### When using an E-commerce catalog

If you use an e-commerce catalog and enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (`catalog_creative_toggle` is `true`), the system will automatically create ads using combinations of three possible formats: catalog carousel, catalog video, and single video.

The possible ad format combinations for your ads are illustrated in the following table.

| Is the catalog carousel format available? | Video danh mục có sẵn? | Video đơn có sẵn? | Kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo cho mẫu quảng cáo của bạn |
|---|---|---|---|
| ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | Chỉ thẻ xoay vòng danh mục (Catalog carousel only) |
| ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video đơn |
| ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video danh mục |
| ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục, video danh mục và video đơn |

To ensure certain ad formats are available in the ads, follow the instructions in the following table.

Ad formatAd format descriptionHow to ensure the ad format is availableHow to configure the parameters

catalog carouselDisplay 2–20 products in a slideshow format. This format will showcase product images of up to 20 products from your catalog at a time.The catalog needs to contain at least two products supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Ensure that the catalog (catalog_id) contains at least two approved products. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-overview-of-a-catalog/v1.3), which should be at least two. • Carousel image selection scope: The product images for products in a catalog (catalog_id) will be dynamically chosen as images in the delivering Catalog Carousel Ads. The scope of product images to choose from is determined by the specified product_specific_type parameter: • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from all products in the catalog. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from products in the specified product set (product_set_id). • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from a customized product range consisting of up to 20 products (product_ids). • Carousel image type: • Use the main images of the products: By default, the main image URLs of the dynamically selected catalog products will be used as Carousel images.
Specify a piece of music supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Pass one music ID that is valid for use in Catalog Carousel Ads via music_info. To obtain a valid music ID, you can use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Catalog Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL in [/file/music/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-music-list/v1.3). • Upload a piece of customized music for Catalog Carousel Ads to an ad account by using any of the following methods: • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL and pass music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3). • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL, upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and pass file_id to [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3).
catalog videoGenerate a dynamic video based on information from the product catalogThe catalog needs to be bound to at least one video template or you need to configure a video URL for each catalog product. The system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video or use the video URL for the catalog product.Ensure that at least one video template is bound to your catalog (catalog_id) or a video URL (video_url) has been configured for each catalog product. • To ensure a video URL has been configured for each catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-products/v1.3) and check the returned video_url. • If you want to add video URLs for your catalog products, use [/catalog/product/update/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/update-products/v1.3). • To ensure that at least one video template (video package) is bound to your catalog, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • To learn about how to create video templates on TikTok Ads Manager, see [How to create video packages in a Catalog](https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/how-to-create-video-packages-in-a-catalog). • To retrieve video templates for your catalog via API, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • If catalog_template_video_id is specified, the specified video template will be used to automatically generate the catalog video for each catalog product. • If catalog_template_video_id is not specified, the system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video. When a product has a video URL, that video will be used instead.
single videoUse specified video creatives to promote your products.Specify additional videosSpecify additional videos via video_info and cover images via image_info.

#### When using a travel catalog

If you use a  travel (hotel, flight, or destination) catalog and enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (`catalog_creative_toggle` is `true`), the system will automatically create ads using combinations of three possible formats: catalog carousel, catalog video, and single video.

The possible ad format combinations for your ads are illustrated in the following table.

| Is the catalog carousel format available? | Video danh mục có sẵn? | Video đơn có sẵn? | Kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo cho mẫu quảng cáo của bạn |
|---|---|---|---|
| ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | Chỉ thẻ xoay vòng danh mục (Catalog carousel only) |
| ✅ | ❌ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video đơn |
| ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục và video danh mục |
| ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | Thẻ xoay vòng danh mục, video danh mục và video đơn |

To ensure certain ad formats are available in ads, follow the instructions in the following table.

Ad formatAd format descriptionHow to ensure the ad format is availableHow to configure the parameters

catalog carouselDisplay 2–20 products in a slideshow format. This format will showcase product images of up to 20 products from your catalog at a time.The catalog needs to contain at least two products supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Ensure that the catalog (catalog_id) contains at least two approved products. You can verify this by checking the value of approved returned from [/catalog/overview/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-overview-of-a-catalog/v1.3), which should be at least two. • Carousel image selection scope: The product images for products in a catalog (catalog_id) will be dynamically chosen as images in the delivering Catalog Carousel Ads. The scope of product images to choose from is determined by the specified product_specific_type parameter: • If product_specific_type is set to ALL, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from all products in the catalog. • If product_specific_type is set to PRODUCT_SET, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from products in the specified product set (product_set_id). • If product_specific_type is set to CUSTOMIZED_PRODUCTS, the system will dynamically choose Carousel images from a customized product range consisting of up to 20 products (product_ids). • Carousel image type: • Use the main images of the products: By default, the main image URLs of the dynamically selected catalog products will be used as Carousel images.
Specify a piece of music supported in Catalog Carousel Ads.Pass one music ID that is valid for use in Catalog Carousel Ads via music_info. To obtain a valid music ID, you can use any of the following methods: • Filter the pieces of music for Catalog Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL in [/file/music/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-the-music-list/v1.3). • Upload a piece of customized music for Catalog Carousel Ads to an ad account by using any of the following methods: • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL and pass music_file and music_signature in [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3). • Specify music_scene as CATALOG_CAROUSEL, upload_type as UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID, and pass file_id to [/file/music/upload/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/upload-a-piece-of-music/v1.3).
catalog videoGenerate a dynamic video based on information from the product catalogThe catalog needs to be bound to at least one video template. The system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video.Ensure that at least one video template is bound to your catalog (catalog_id). • To ensure that at least one video template (video package) is bound to your catalog, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • To learn about how to create video templates on TikTok Ads Manager, see [How to create video packages in a Catalog](https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/how-to-create-video-packages-in-a-catalog). • To retrieve video templates for your catalog via API, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](https://business-api.tiktok.com/portal/docs/get-video-packages/v1.3). • If catalog_template_video_id is specified, the specified video template will be used to automatically generate the catalog video for each catalog product. • If catalog_template_video_id is not specified, the system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video. When a product has a video URL, that video will be used instead.
single videoUse specified video creatives to promote your products.Specify additional videos or TikTok video postsSpecify individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both. • For Spark Ads created by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify additional TikTok video posts via tiktok_item_id. • For Spark Ads created by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify additional videos via video_info and cover images via image_info, and one to five ad texts (ad_text_list).

#### When using an entertainment catalog

If you use an entertainment catalog and enable auto-selection of catalog creatives (`catalog_creative_toggle` is `true`), the system will automatically create ads using combinations of two possible formats: catalog video and single video.

The possible ad format combinations are illustrated in the following table.

| Video danh mục có sẵn? | Video đơn có sẵn? | Kết hợp định dạng quảng cáo cho mẫu quảng cáo của bạn |
|---|---|---|
| ✅ | ❌ | Catalog carousel and catalog video |
| ✅ | ✅ | Catalog carousel, catalog video, and single video |

To ensure certain ad formats are available in ads, follow the instructions in the following table.

| Định dạng quảng cáo | Mô tả định dạng quảng cáo | Cách đảm bảo định dạng có sẵn | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|
| catalog video | Generate a dynamic video based on information from the product catalog | The catalog needs to be bound to at least one video template or you need to configure a video URL for each catalog product. ⏎ The system will automatically select one of your video templates for each catalog product to generate the corresponding catalog video or use the video URL for the catalog product. | Ensure that at least one video template is bound to your catalog (`catalog_id`) or a video URL (`video_url`) has been configured for each catalog product. • To ensure a video URL has been configured for each catalog product, use [/catalog/product/get/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740564136678402) and check the returned `video_url`. • If you want to add video URLs for your catalog products, use [/catalog/product/update/](../12-api-reference/28-catalog-products-p2.md#doc-1740562287852546). • To ensure that at least one video template (video package) is bound to your catalog, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](../12-api-reference/31-catalog-video-templates.md#doc-1740574099715073). • To learn about how to create video templates on TikTok Ads Manager, see [How to create video packages in a Catalog](https://ads.tiktok.com/help/article/how-to-create-video-packages-in-a-catalog). • To retrieve video templates for your catalog via API, use [/catalog/video_package/get/](../12-api-reference/31-catalog-video-templates.md#doc-1740574099715073). |
| single video | Use specified video creatives to promote your products. | Specify additional videos or TikTok video posts | Specify individual videos, video posts, or a combination of both. • For Spark Ads created by pulling existing TikTok posts from the TikTok account, specify additional TikTok video posts via `tiktok_item_id`. • For Spark Ads created by pushing videos to the TikTok account, specify additional videos via `video_info` and cover images via `image_info`, and one to five ad texts (`ad_text_list`). |

### Ví dụ lệnh cURL (Example)
Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
curl --location --request POST 'https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/smart_plus/ad/create/' \
--header 'Access-Token: {{Access-Token}}' \
--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \
--data '{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
    "landing_page_url_list": [
        {
            "landing_page_url": "{{landing_page_url}}"
        }
    ],
    "creative_list": [
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "CATALOG_CAROUSEL",
                "music_info": {
                    "music_id": "{{music_id}}"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "creative_info": {
                "ad_format": "SINGLE_VIDEO",
                "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
                "video_info": {
                    "video_id": "{{video_id}}"
                },
                "image_info": [
                    {
                        "web_uri": "{{web_uri}}"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "ad_text_list": [
        {
            "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}"
        }
    ],
    "ad_configuration": {
        "product_specific_type": "ALL",
        "identity_type": "BC_AUTH_TT",
        "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
        "identity_authorized_bc_id": "{{identity_authorized_bc_id}}",
        "catalog_creative_toggle": true,
        "catalog_creative_info": {
            "catalog_media_settings": [
                "VIDEO",
                "IMAGE",
                "TEMPLATE_VIDEO"
            ]
        },
        "call_to_action_id": "{{call_to_action_id}}"
    }
}'
```
Phản hồi (Response)
```http
// curl
{
    "code": 0,
    "message": "OK",
    "request_id": "{{request_id}}",
    "data": {
        "ad_configuration": {
            "call_to_action_id": "{{call_to_action_id}}",
            "catalog_creative_info": {
