Once you have created Search Ads Campaigns, you can use [Reporting API](../12-api-reference/58-reporting.md#doc-1740302665828417) to retrieve data segmented by Search Keyword using the `search_keyword` dimension or data segmented by Match Type using the `match_type` dimension in [basic reports](../09-marketing-api/bao-cao-p1.md#doc-1751443956638721).

