<!-- doc_id: 1839876593708034 -->
# Tạo quảng cáo tối ưu hóa cho cả Trang web và Ứng dụng (`Create ads with Website and App Optimization`)
> Đường dẫn: Tình huống sử dụng > Tạo chiến dịch > Tạo quảng cáo tối ưu hóa cho cả Trang web và Ứng dụng
Bài viết này hướng dẫn bạn từng bước để tạo ads with Website and App Optimization.

## Giới thiệu (Introduction)
Website and App Optimization is available for businesses with both website and app channels. The feature is designed to unlock the full potential of user interest and conversion opportunity by combining both website and app audiences in a unified campaign strategy.

**You can use Campaign Management API to create ads with Website and App Optimization, and this helps you streamline your ad creation experience, and elevate operational efficiency and scalability.**

## Điều kiện tiên quyết (Prerequisites)
- You've gained access to TikTok API for Business. See [Get Started - Step by step workflow](../04-get-started/bat-dau.md#doc-1735713609895937) for details. 
  - To create ads with Website and App Optimization, you need relevant permissions. See **API Reference** to find out permissions required for endpoints (including the endpoints listed in the "Steps" section) and see [Update app permissions](../04-get-started/bat-dau.md#doc-1738855280338946) to find out how to configure permissions.
 - Creating ads with Website and App Optimization is currently an allowlist-only feature. If you would like to access it, please contact your TikTok representative.

## Các bước thực hiện (Steps)
Based on your preference for using a catalog to promote your products and the campaign type, you have the flexibility to create three types of ads with Website and App Optimization:
- Manual Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization: This type of ad is within a Manual Campaign and uses a catalog to promote your products. For detailed instructions on creating such ads, see [Create Manual Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1839882947475458).
- Manual Non-Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization: This type of ad is within a Manual Campaign and doesn't use a catalog to promote your products. For detailed instructions on creating such ads, see [Create Manual Non-Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1839882969587906).
- Smart+ Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization: This type of ad is within a Smart+ Campaign and uses a catalog to promote your products. For detailed instructions on creating such ads, see [Create Smart+ Catalog Ads with Website and App Optimization](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1842232769643905).

