```

3. Tạo mẫu quảng cáo bằng cách gọi endpoint [/ad/create/](../12-api-reference/02-ads-p1.md#doc-1739953377508354). Note that the following requirements must be met.

**For Standard Carousel Non-Spark Ads or Standard Carousel Spark Ads via Spark Ads Push**

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|
| Identity | Any of the following options: • Custom User (custom identity) • TikTok User • TikTok Account User in Business Center | `identity_type` | Any of the following values: • `CUSTOMIZED_USER` • `TT_USER` • `BC_AUTH_TT` ⏎ To learn more about Spark Ads, see [Create Spark Ads](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1739470744631298). |
| Ad format | Carousel Ads | `ad_format` | `CAROUSEL_ADS` |
| Ad creative - Images | one to 35 images supported in the Carousel Ad | `image_ids` | Pass one to 35 image IDs. ⏎ You need to get the image IDs by using [/file/image/ad/upload/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1739067433456642) and [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506). ⏎ The image to be used in Carousel Ads should meet the requirements below **at the same time**:  •  Specifications:  •  File Type: JPG, JPEG, or PNG. •  Image Resolution: a maximum of 1242 x 2340 pixels or 2340 x 1242 pixels. •  Aspect Ratio: a maximum of 9:20 or 20:9. •  File Size: below 50 MB.  •  The value of the parameter `is_carousel_usable` returned from [/file/image/ad/search/](../12-api-reference/47-images.md#doc-1740052016789506) for the image is `true`. |
| Ad creative - Music | A piece of music supported in the Carousel Ad | `music_id` | Pass one music ID that is valid for use in non-VSA Carousel Ads. ⏎ To obtain a valid music ID, you can  • filter the pieces of music for non-VSA Carousel Ads under an ad account by specifying `music_scene` as `CAROUSEL_ADS` in [/file/music/get/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740053909509122). • OR upload a piece of customized music for non-VSA Carousel Ads to an ad account by:  • specifying `music_scene` as `CAROUSEL_ADS` and passing `music_file` and `music_signature` in [/file/music/upload/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740052650395650) • OR specifying `music_scene` as `CAROUSEL_ADS` , specifying `upload_type` as `UPLOAD_BY_FILE_ID`, and passing `file_id` in [/file/music/upload/](../12-api-reference/52-music.md#doc-1740052650395650). |
| Interactive Add-on | Disabled | `card_id` | Not passed |

**For Standard Carousel Spark Ads via Spark Ads Pull**

| Thiết lập (Setting) | Yêu cầu (Requirement) | Tham số (Parameter) | Hướng dẫn cấu hình tham số |
|---|---|---|---|
| Identity | Any of the following options: • Authorized User • TikTok User • TikTok Account User in Business Center | `identity_type` | Any of the following values: • `AUTH_CODE` • `TT_USER` • `BC_AUTH_TT` ⏎ To learn more about Spark Ads, see [Create Spark Ads](use-case-tao-chien-dich-p2.md#doc-1739470744631298). |
| Ad format | Carousel Ads | `ad_format` | `CAROUSEL_ADS` |
| Ad creative - Post | Enabled | `tiktok_item_id` | Specify a valid value. ⏎ To filter photo posts under an identity, use [/identity/video/get/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218475032577) or [/identity/video/info/](../12-api-reference/46-identity.md#doc-1740218522178562) and set `item_type` to `CAROUSEL`. |
| Ad creative - Post - Stitch and Duet | Disabled | • `item_duet_status` • `item_stitch_status` | Not passed |
| Ad creative- Images & Muisc | Disabled | • `image_ids` •  `music_id` | Not passed |
| Interactive Add-on | Disabled | `card_id` | Not passed |

**Ví dụ mẫu (Example)**

Yêu cầu (Request)
```http
// curl
{
    "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
    "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
    "creatives": [{
        "ad_format": "CAROUSEL_ADS",
        "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
        "ad_text": "{{ad_text}}",
        "call_to_action": "SHOP_NOW",
        "image_ids":["{{image_id}}", "{{image_id}}"],
        "music_id":"{{music_id}}",
        "identity_id":"{{identity_id}}",
        "identity_type":"CUSTOMIZED_USER",
        "landing_page_url":"{{landing_page_url}}"
    }]
}
```

Phản hồi (Response)
```http
// curl
{
    "code": 0,
    "message": "OK",
    "request_id": "{{request_id}}",
    "data": {
        "ad_ids": [
            "{{ad_id}}"
        ],
        "need_audit": false,
        "creatives": [
            {
                "ad_texts": null,
                "vast_moat_enabled": false,
                "tracking_app_id": "{{tracking_app_id}}",
                "identity_id": "{{identity_id}}",
                "ad_id": "{{ad_id}}",
                "call_to_action_id": null,
                "operation_status": "ENABLE",
                "creative_type": null,
                "deeplink_type": "NORMAL",
                "brand_safety_postbid_partner": "UNSET",
                "call_to_action": "SHOP_NOW",
                "campaign_id": "{{campaign_id}}",
                "is_new_structure": true,
                "tracking_offline_event_set_ids": [
                    "{{tracking_offline_event_set_id}}",
                    "{{tracking_offline_event_set_id}}"
                ],
                "advertiser_id": "{{advertiser_id}}",
                "optimization_event": null,
                "landing_page_urls": null,
                "adgroup_id": "{{adgroup_id}}",
                "ad_name": "{{ad_name}}",
                "campaign_name": "{{campaign_name}}",
                "landing_page_url": "",
                "impression_tracking_url": null,
                "deeplink": "",
                "modify_time": "2023-05-15 06:39:22",
                "music_id": "{{}}",
                "ad_format": "CAROUSEL_ADS",
                "profile_image_url": "{{profile_image_url}}",
                "viewability_postbid_partner": "UNSET",
                "video_id": null,
