5. Preview an ad using [/creative/ads_preview/create/](../12-api-reference/38-creative-tools.md#doc-1739403070695426). We offer preview types of `AD` and `ADS_CREATION` to enable you to preview VSA Carousel Ads that you plan to create, and existing VSA Carousel Ads.

