### Bước 6: Tạo nhóm quảng cáo DSA (Create an ad group)

Creating a DSA ad group follows a similar process as creating other ad groups. You need to pass in the `catalog_id` to the request. For a retargeting campaign, you need to set a value for the `shopping_ads_retargeting_type` parameter.

## Retargeting settings at the ad group level

DSA retargeting is configured via the `shopping_ads_retargeting_type` field and several other fields. Possible configurations are:

| Loại nhắm lại mục tiêu (Retargeting Type) | Mô tả chi tiết | Cài đặt cho các trường khác |
|---|---|---|
|OFF|No retargeting. When this type is selected, the ad will direct to the app install.|No need to specify values for `included_custom_actions`, `excluded_custom_actions`, and `shopping_ads_retargeting_actions_days`.|
|LAB1|Viewed product or added product to cart but not purchased|Need to pass in `shopping_ads_retargeting_actions_days`. No need to pass in the other two fields.|
|LAB2|Added product to cart but not purchased|Need to pass in `shopping_ads_retargeting_actions_days`. No need to pass in the other two fields.|
|LAB3|Custom combination|Pass in `included_custom_actions`, `excluded_custom_actions`. Specify the custom actions you want to include and exclude for `included_custom_actions` and `excluded_custom_actions` fields.|

## Yêu cầu gọi API (Request) 

**Address** https://business-api.tiktok.com/open_api/v1.3/adgroup/create/

**Method** POST

**Tiêu đề (Header)**

| Trường (Field) | Kiểu dữ liệu | Mô tả chi tiết |
|---|---|---|
| Access-Token  ****(Bắt buộc)**** | string | Mã truy cập được ủy quyền (Access Token). Để biết chi tiết, xem [Authentication](../09-marketing-api/marketing-api-xac-thuc-uy-quyen.md#doc-1738373164380162). |
| Content-Type  ****(Bắt buộc)**** | string | Request content type. Allowed Value:"application/json" |

**Danh sách tham số (Parameters)**

| Trường (Field) | Kiểu dữ liệu | Mô tả chi tiết |
|---|---|---|
| advertiser_id | string | ID tài khoản quảng cáo TikTok |
| campaign_id | string | ID chiến dịch quảng cáo |
| placement_type | string | PLACEMENT_TYPE_NORMAL |
| placements | string[] | ["PLACEMENT_TIKTOK", "PLACEMENT_PANGLE] |
| promotion_type**(Điều kiện)** | string | Promotion type and you can decide where you'd like to promote your products using this field. You need to specify the field when advertising objective (`objective_type`) for your campaign is NOT set as `REACH`, `VIDEO_VIEWS`, or `ENGAGEMENT`. ⏎ See [Enumeration - Promoted Object Type](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1737174886619138) for details. |
| location_ids | string[] | List of codes for targeted countries or regions. The locations here must be consistent with the locations that you have configured for the catalog. See **Appendix-Location IDs** for details. |
| budget | number | Advertising budget |
| budget_mode | string | Ad budget type. Các giá trị enum hỗ trợ: BUDGET_MODE_DAY,  BUDGET_MODE_TOTAL |
| schedule_type | string | Ad schedule type. Allowed values: SCHEDULE_FROM_NOW,SCHEDULE_START_END. For details,  see [Enumeration - Schedule type](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1737174886619138). |
| schedule_start_time | datetime | Ad delivery start time (UTC+0), in the format of "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS". For example, "2017-01-01 00:00:00" |
| schedule_end_time | datetime | Ad delivery end time (UTC+0), in the format of "YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS". For example, "2017-01-01 00:00:00" Only Bắt buộc khi `schedule_type` is `SCHEDULE_START_END`. |
| optimization_goal | string | Optimization goal. See [Enumeration - Ad Management - Optimization Goal](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1737174886619138) for details. |
| pacing | string | Ad delivery speed type. Allowed value include: `PACING_MODE_FAST`, `PACING_MODE_SMOOTH` |
| billing_event | string | Billing event. See [Enumeration -Billing event](../15-appendix/phu-luc-p1.md#doc-1737174886619138) for optional values |
| catalog_id | string | ID danh mục sản phẩm |
| product_set_id | string | Product Set ID of the catalog, pass 0 means select all. The Giá trị mặc định is 0. |
| shopping_ads_retargeting_type | string | The types of ad redirection in the catalog: `LAB1`，`LAB2`, `LAB3`,  `OFF`. |
| shopping_ads_retargeting_actions_days | number | The effective number of days for the ad redirection condition of the catalog . Only Bắt buộc khi `shopping_ads_retargeting_type` is `LAB1` or `LAB2`. Value range: 1, 2, 3, 7, 14, 30, 60, 90, 180. |
| skip_learning_phase | boolean | Có thực hiện skip the learning phase. It only takes effect when the corresponding campaign `objective_type` is `CATALOG_SALES` and `bid_type` is `OCPM`. |

